(581256, 60485, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like your shot a lot.  great minimalism and lighting which creates a very strong clean image.  nice job.<br/> <br/>your downfall in this challenge could be that your true subject isn''t really one of the four elements.  however, i still really like it regardless of the challenge.</td>', 'i really like your shot a lot.  great minimalism and lighting which creates a very strong clean image.  nice job. your downfall in this challenge could be that your true subject isn''t really one of the four elements.  however, i still really like it regardless of the challenge.', '2004-02-16 02:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(581258, 60667, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the cropping choice, in that it''s much more interesting than seeing the whole bath.  however, there is still some room for improvement in creating a cleaner and less distracting picture.  the background contains a lot of unimportant distractions that could be eliminated.<br/> <br/>you''ve got a nice start with the crop.</td>', 'i like the cropping choice, in that it''s much more interesting than seeing the whole bath.  however, there is still some room for improvement in creating a cleaner and less distracting picture.  the background contains a lot of unimportant distractions that could be eliminated. you''ve got a nice start with the crop.', '2004-02-16 02:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(581259, 60368, 259, '<td valign="top">very nicely presented.  i really like the thick border.  probably the most impressive shot i''ve seen so far.  however, i still think it could be even stronger if there was a little more balence.  maybe a rock in the lower right corner or something to keep the picture from feeling heavy toward the left.  it''s a 10 anyway.</td>', 'very nicely presented.  i really like the thick border.  probably the most impressive shot i''ve seen so far.  however, i still think it could be even stronger if there was a little more balence.  maybe a rock in the lower right corner or something to keep the picture from feeling heavy toward the left.  it''s a 10 anyway.', '2004-02-16 02:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
