(581394, 59496, 16957, '<td valign="top">Pretty small animal but a bit of a stretch of the theme which I think the Greeks observed as the elements of the universe before the arrival of living things.</td>', 'Pretty small animal but a bit of a stretch of the theme which I think the Greeks observed as the elements of the universe before the arrival of living things.', '2004-02-16 06:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(581402, 60652, 16957, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the focus on the flower is great but the hand IMHO detracts from the overall image. It''s paleness and the earth under the fingernails are distracting. Remove the hand and I would have scored another point higher. Really like the way the flower screams out for attention though - well done.</td>', 'I like the idea and the focus on the flower is great but the hand IMHO detracts from the overall image. It''s paleness and the earth under the fingernails are distracting. Remove the hand and I would have scored another point higher. Really like the way the flower screams out for attention though - well done.', '2004-02-16 06:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
