(581412, 60255, 16957, '<td valign="top">Very nice observation. Personally I''m scoring strictly natural interpretations of the theme higher but this represents a very basic harnessing of elements in such a way that does not compromise the idea behind the theme. Well shot</td>', 'Very nice observation. Personally I''m scoring strictly natural interpretations of the theme higher but this represents a very basic harnessing of elements in such a way that does not compromise the idea behind the theme. Well shot', '2004-02-16 06:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(581418, 60480, 16957, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. The colour and the texture are beautifully observed. Good entry for texture too!</td>', 'I like this a lot. The colour and the texture are beautifully observed. Good entry for texture too!', '2004-02-16 06:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(581424, 60427, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like the high-key, but your framing and composition of this image make that seem like an accident. For me, you shoudl have placed the horizon higher in frame, and shown more of the foreground - that would provide balance between the two land-masses, and reduce the top of frame negative space (which seems to add very little in terms of impact).</td>', 'I like the high-key, but your framing and composition of this image make that seem like an accident. For me, you shoudl have placed the horizon higher in frame, and shown more of the foreground - that would provide balance between the two land-masses, and reduce the top of frame negative space (which seems to add very little in terms of impact).', '2004-02-16 06:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(581425, 59989, 16957, '<td valign="top">Well imagined. I suspect this is some kind of a water sculpture or fountain in an urban setting? It is a fine composition and the effects of light and water are nicely framed. The background street (?) lights, buildings and vegetation are a distraction though. A shallower depth of field would have eliminated these and got you an extra point from my own personal viewpoint or course..!</td>', 'Well imagined. I suspect this is some kind of a water sculpture or fountain in an urban setting? It is a fine composition and the effects of light and water are nicely framed. The background street (?) lights, buildings and vegetation are a distraction though. A shallower depth of field would have eliminated these and got you an extra point from my own personal viewpoint or course..!', '2004-02-16 06:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(581428, 60490, 16957, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured and an imaginative interpretation. Coulours and framing are excellent. The only thing that lets this shot down I think is the street lighting and ligths on the horizon. Guess you couldn''t do much about these though so my score is not affected. well done.</td>', 'Beautifully captured and an imaginative interpretation. Coulours and framing are excellent. The only thing that lets this shot down I think is the street lighting and ligths on the horizon. Guess you couldn''t do much about these though so my score is not affected. well done.', '2004-02-16 06:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
