(581777, 60587, 12049, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, and a great soft feel to this one. There''s a bit of lens flare on the right hand side, which you could have corrected given that this is an advanced rules challenge.</td>', 'Very nice composition, and a great soft feel to this one. There''s a bit of lens flare on the right hand side, which you could have corrected given that this is an advanced rules challenge.', '2004-02-16 11:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(581778, 59787, 12049, '<td valign="top">A bit too literal. I think that you should stretch your self and go for something a little more creative.</td>', 'A bit too literal. I think that you should stretch your self and go for something a little more creative.', '2004-02-16 11:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(581779, 59722, 14603, '<td valign="top">A hard subject very well captured.</td>', 'A hard subject very well captured.', '2004-02-16 11:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
