(581783, 60179, 12049, '<td valign="top">You really really need a shallow DOF here - though if you are using a small sensor camera this wouldn''t normally be possible. Becasue the surface of the frog is so abstract, I find my eye drawn to the more easily recognisable background.</td>', 'You really really need a shallow DOF here - though if you are using a small sensor camera this wouldn''t normally be possible. Becasue the surface of the frog is so abstract, I find my eye drawn to the more easily recognisable background.', '2004-02-16 11:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(581785, 60520, 14603, '<td valign="top">Like everything about this...it has the look of a winner.</td>', 'Like everything about this...it has the look of a winner.', '2004-02-16 11:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(581787, 59985, 12049, '<td valign="top">Great colors and a nice composition. The only minor points are that the horizon isn''t quite level and the main lwindmill overlaps with one behind it. It would have been great to see the bottoms of the towers, but given the darkness that probably wouldn''t be possible without losing the coloration in the sky.</td>', 'Great colors and a nice composition. The only minor points are that the horizon isn''t quite level and the main lwindmill overlaps with one behind it. It would have been great to see the bottoms of the towers, but given the darkness that probably wouldn''t be possible without losing the coloration in the sky.', '2004-02-16 11:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(581789, 60678, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good composition adds interest to this image.</td>', 'Good composition adds interest to this image.', '2004-02-16 11:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(581843, 60489, 16636, '<td valign="top">Good,  but horizon not being horizontal is a bit distracting to me and I would have moved in closer to the waters edge to take the foreground detail away</td>', 'Good,  but horizon not being horizontal is a bit distracting to me and I would have moved in closer to the waters edge to take the foreground detail away', '2004-02-16 12:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
