(583367, 60396, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the textures on the rocks and snow. I think the effect of moving water is more exagerrated than it needs to be - you can hardly tell the water from the snow. A slightly faster shutter speed to get some blur but not too much.</td>', 'I like the textures on the rocks and snow. I think the effect of moving water is more exagerrated than it needs to be - you can hardly tell the water from the snow. A slightly faster shutter speed to get some blur but not too much.', '2004-02-17 12:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
