(583733, 60522, 11843, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea! Great capture, focus. Alone, I don''t think this water bubble shot wouldn''t have had as much impact. I like how you introduced some color with your model. But, on the other hand,,,,I would sure like to see her reacting to the bubble bursting by looking at the bubble, not me. Cheers....Martin</td>', 'Very interesting idea! Great capture, focus. Alone, I don''t think this water bubble shot wouldn''t have had as much impact. I like how you introduced some color with your model. But, on the other hand,,,,I would sure like to see her reacting to the bubble bursting by looking at the bubble, not me. Cheers....Martin', '2004-02-17 18:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
