(583813, 60652, 3697, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of DOF, I must say. And also I like the selective saturation. The photo (other than the flower) does seem a bit grainy but this may have been what you were going for. Either way, it''s well done and meets the challenge very nicely.</td>', 'Excellent use of DOF, I must say. And also I like the selective saturation. The photo (other than the flower) does seem a bit grainy but this may have been what you were going for. Either way, it''s well done and meets the challenge very nicely.', '2004-02-17 19:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
