(586127, 59787, 15751, '<td valign="top">cool idea.  I think maybe the lighting is not as dramatic as it could be.  The symmetry is very nice.  I think that choice of cropping/framing could have been better too.  Overall nice composition though.</td>', 'cool idea.  I think maybe the lighting is not as dramatic as it could be.  The symmetry is very nice.  I think that choice of cropping/framing could have been better too.  Overall nice composition though.', '2004-02-18 15:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(586131, 60590, 15751, '<td valign="top">nice vantage point, but it seems like you got a lot of technical problems with this photo.  Focus is not quite sharp and there is a lot of light diffusion bluring out the tree.  Perhaps a different framing and at sunset would be nicer.</td>', 'nice vantage point, but it seems like you got a lot of technical problems with this photo.  Focus is not quite sharp and there is a lot of light diffusion bluring out the tree.  Perhaps a different framing and at sunset would be nicer.', '2004-02-18 15:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
