(586157, 60382, 15751, '<td valign="top">wow, really cool idea.  The contrast works well.  Only thing I dont like is the framing around the glass, it seems a little off center and too much negative space in the wrong places.</td>', 'wow, really cool idea.  The contrast works well.  Only thing I dont like is the framing around the glass, it seems a little off center and too much negative space in the wrong places.', '2004-02-18 16:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
