(586871, 60397, 1202, '<td valign="top">It looks as though you had all of the ingrediants for an exceptional shot.   The limbs of the trees are very distracting.   Maybe it would have improved your shot if you had worked them in to frame the main subject, the wonderfully bright boat.  4</td>', 'It looks as though you had all of the ingrediants for an exceptional shot.   The limbs of the trees are very distracting.   Maybe it would have improved your shot if you had worked them in to frame the main subject, the wonderfully bright boat.  4', '2004-02-18 21:33:26.000000', NULL, 1);
