(587475, 60671, 17520, '<td valign="top">The color is so vivid and the texture of the glass bring a lot to the photo.</td>', 'The color is so vivid and the texture of the glass bring a lot to the photo.', '2004-02-19 04:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(587633, 60421, 16636, '<td valign="top">sorry but I didn''t like you pic very much - the background drape is very distracting to me</td>', 'sorry but I didn''t like you pic very much - the background drape is very distracting to me', '2004-02-19 07:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(587638, 60010, 16636, '<td valign="top">liked you composition, good dof but seems quite noisy to me</td>', 'liked you composition, good dof but seems quite noisy to me', '2004-02-19 07:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(587640, 60509, 16636, '<td valign="top">the halo is distracting - I think a more realistic photo would have worked better</td>', 'the halo is distracting - I think a more realistic photo would have worked better', '2004-02-19 07:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(587648, 59834, 16636, '<td valign="top">nice composition but I don''t think it fits the subject</td>', 'nice composition but I don''t think it fits the subject', '2004-02-19 07:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(587765, 60582, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like this but the tilt to the left and the slight darkness in the corners (vignetteing)cost it a point</td>', 'I like this but the tilt to the left and the slight darkness in the corners (vignetteing)cost it a point', '2004-02-19 09:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(587778, 60666, 1202, '<td valign="top">I feel that with no particular point of interest other than the whole pine cone it should have all been in the depth of field.  A longer exposure with a smaller aperature would have accomplished this. Just my opinion.   4</td>', 'I feel that with no particular point of interest other than the whole pine cone it should have all been in the depth of field.  A longer exposure with a smaller aperature would have accomplished this. Just my opinion.   4', '2004-02-19 09:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(587787, 60516, 1202, '<td valign="top">My monitor makes this look both over and under exposed, with the flame blown out and therest granier than necessary.   I think and additional light source may have helped make this a shot with more WOW factor.  4</td>', 'My monitor makes this look both over and under exposed, with the flame blown out and therest granier than necessary.   I think and additional light source may have helped make this a shot with more WOW factor.  4', '2004-02-19 09:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(587805, 60582, 1202, '<td valign="top">This was probably a very pretty setting but the unclarified birds in the BG make the lake look very dirty and distract from your reflection.   It is a little canted also and the lake should be level if possible.  4</td>', 'This was probably a very pretty setting but the unclarified birds in the BG make the lake look very dirty and distract from your reflection.   It is a little canted also and the lake should be level if possible.  4', '2004-02-19 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587810, 60143, 1202, '<td valign="top">This image shows that you have command of your camera.  It took me a second to figure out just what it was but I knew I liked it as soon as I saw it.   Nice job.  9</td>', 'This image shows that you have command of your camera.  It took me a second to figure out just what it was but I knew I liked it as soon as I saw it.   Nice job.  9', '2004-02-19 10:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(587818, 60267, 1202, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome exposure, but there is something about the balance that is disturbing to me.  I can''t pinpoint it but it is just there.    7</td>', 'This is an awesome exposure, but there is something about the balance that is disturbing to me.  I can''t pinpoint it but it is just there.    7', '2004-02-19 10:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(587820, 60146, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice but a little more contrast might have made it even better</td>', 'very nice but a little more contrast might have made it even better', '2004-02-19 10:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(587828, 60589, 1202, '<td valign="top">A wonderful and romantic setting.   I feel the chair in the foreground/left should have been removed.   Less exposure for the flame and some fill flash might have given this more pop.  Nice work though.  5</td>', 'A wonderful and romantic setting.   I feel the chair in the foreground/left should have been removed.   Less exposure for the flame and some fill flash might have given this more pop.  Nice work though.  5', '2004-02-19 10:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(587841, 60020, 1202, '<td valign="top">It looks so calm every where ecept  the rag or towel blowing.  I think if it had a more desolate BG it might have more impact for me.  5</td>', 'It looks so calm every where ecept  the rag or towel blowing.  I think if it had a more desolate BG it might have more impact for me.  5', '2004-02-19 10:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(587849, 60368, 1202, '<td valign="top">In my opinion you gave it a little too much exposure, losing the feel of the water.   It turned out more like a foggy appearance to me.   Nice try at a difficult task.  5</td>', 'In my opinion you gave it a little too much exposure, losing the feel of the water.   It turned out more like a foggy appearance to me.   Nice try at a difficult task.  5', '2004-02-19 10:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(587853, 60143, 14620, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and motion in this shot.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Love the colors and motion in this shot.  Very nice work.', '2004-02-19 10:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(587856, 60587, 1202, '<td valign="top">A nice, clean, well comopsed image.   You have captured the moment, beautifull scene.  8</td>', 'A nice, clean, well comopsed image.   You have captured the moment, beautifull scene.  8', '2004-02-19 10:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(587858, 60107, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the flames.  Really looks like they''re dancing.  Nice colors as well.</td>', 'Great capture of the flames.  Really looks like they''re dancing.  Nice colors as well.', '2004-02-19 10:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(587874, 59913, 1202, '<td valign="top">I am left wondering what it is.   You have attempted a difficult task of getting all of the exposures at their best.   With the intense light from the blast making the rest of the subject underexposed, you might have tried a shorter exposure with some added light on the foreground.   4</td>', 'I am left wondering what it is.   You have attempted a difficult task of getting all of the exposures at their best.   With the intense light from the blast making the rest of the subject underexposed, you might have tried a shorter exposure with some added light on the foreground.   4', '2004-02-19 10:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587908, 60271, 11895, '<td valign="top">very good idea, wish it was larger and maybe a bit sharper</td>', 'very good idea, wish it was larger and maybe a bit sharper', '2004-02-19 10:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(587911, 60376, 1202, '<td valign="top">If you have the means, pictures of this type require less exposure.  The sand and water are so intense that they give your camera a false sense of exposure for your main subject.   You should have also tried to get the horizon dead level.  5</td>', 'If you have the means, pictures of this type require less exposure.  The sand and water are so intense that they give your camera a false sense of exposure for your main subject.   You should have also tried to get the horizon dead level.  5', '2004-02-19 10:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(587915, 60250, 1202, '<td valign="top">A very artisitc image that sets the mood well,  but almost too dark for me. 6</td>', 'A very artisitc image that sets the mood well,  but almost too dark for me. 6', '2004-02-19 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(587919, 60290, 1202, '<td valign="top">A very nice composition.  I think I would prefer that the blacks be a bit blacker with less of the sepia cast.  6</td>', 'A very nice composition.  I think I would prefer that the blacks be a bit blacker with less of the sepia cast.  6', '2004-02-19 10:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(587932, 59919, 1202, '<td valign="top">What happened to the top of the flame that made you crop it off.   As you present tnis it leaves me wondering what the whole image is.  You had plenty of light to get a clearer image, which in my opinion would be better.  4</td>', 'What happened to the top of the flame that made you crop it off.   As you present tnis it leaves me wondering what the whole image is.  You had plenty of light to get a clearer image, which in my opinion would be better.  4', '2004-02-19 10:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(587946, 60567, 11895, '<td valign="top">good detail in the snow and ice</td>', 'good detail in the snow and ice', '2004-02-19 10:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(587961, 59994, 1202, '<td valign="top">A very different view.  I think it could have more impact if you could have taken it with a bit more perspective giving the tracks depth by letting them get smaller in the BG.  As is it is kind of flat and not working for the viewer.  5</td>', 'A very different view.  I think it could have more impact if you could have taken it with a bit more perspective giving the tracks depth by letting them get smaller in the BG.  As is it is kind of flat and not working for the viewer.  5', '2004-02-19 10:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(587965, 60430, 1202, '<td valign="top">Yes!  9</td>', 'Yes!  9', '2004-02-19 10:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(587970, 60293, 1202, '<td valign="top">I think less thistles would be better, they are kind of busy for such a serene setting.  6</td>', 'I think less thistles would be better, they are kind of busy for such a serene setting.  6', '2004-02-19 10:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(587981, 60179, 1202, '<td valign="top">A superb subject, could you have moved around and took it with less of the distracting BG?  The reflective light from the frog is awesome, a shot more down on it with just the snow in the BG would have been terrific.  6</td>', 'A superb subject, could you have moved around and took it with less of the distracting BG?  The reflective light from the frog is awesome, a shot more down on it with just the snow in the BG would have been terrific.  6', '2004-02-19 11:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(587994, 60522, 11895, '<td valign="top">needs more DoF</td>', 'needs more DoF', '2004-02-19 11:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(588023, 60020, 14476, '<td valign="top">Good seeing to capture this one!</td>', 'Good seeing to capture this one!', '2004-02-19 11:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(588027, 60640, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect title for the image.  Nicely photographed.</td>', 'This is a perfect title for the image.  Nicely photographed.', '2004-02-19 11:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(588031, 60396, 14476, '<td valign="top">I very much appreciate the contrast between the greens, snow and silky water.  Added interest of the cave-like opening makes the photo exciting as well.</td>', 'I very much appreciate the contrast between the greens, snow and silky water.  Added interest of the cave-like opening makes the photo exciting as well.', '2004-02-19 11:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(588032, 60250, 11895, '<td valign="top">good idea that fits the topic but way too dark</td>', 'good idea that fits the topic but way too dark', '2004-02-19 11:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(588033, 60272, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nature''s necklace.  Well seen and nicely photographed.</td>', 'Nature''s necklace.  Well seen and nicely photographed.', '2004-02-19 11:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(588035, 60146, 14476, '<td valign="top">And you folks get a lot of both wind and water...  Lovely soft photograph with the bit of red adding the needed emphasis.</td>', 'And you folks get a lot of both wind and water...  Lovely soft photograph with the bit of red adding the needed emphasis.', '2004-02-19 11:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(588042, 60221, 11895, '<td valign="top">this one might have looked nicer in color</td>', 'this one might have looked nicer in color', '2004-02-19 11:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(588047, 59722, 14476, '<td valign="top">Trees and fog.  surely elemental!  Beautifully photographed but the white/black rather heavy border is, perhaps, not the perfect complement to the delicacy of the image.  Final product is still well above average.</td>', 'Trees and fog.  surely elemental!  Beautifully photographed but the white/black rather heavy border is, perhaps, not the perfect complement to the delicacy of the image.  Final product is still well above average.', '2004-02-19 11:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(588048, 59776, 11895, '<td valign="top">pretty dark</td>', 'pretty dark', '2004-02-19 11:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(588055, 60490, 14476, '<td valign="top">This lovely church looks as if it might have been submitted by one of our Icelandic members.  Beautifully photographed  with the richly colored church lighting contrasting well with the great storm clouds.  Good seeing, whereever this is!</td>', 'This lovely church looks as if it might have been submitted by one of our Icelandic members.  Beautifully photographed  with the richly colored church lighting contrasting well with the great storm clouds.  Good seeing, whereever this is!', '2004-02-19 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(588065, 59649, 14476, '<td valign="top">Some people don''t like water drops.  I do.  This one is original and because it is, I''d like to have seen more of the flame and maybe less of the bottom background gray.  But it''s a very creditable entry.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Some people don''t like water drops.  I do.  This one is original and because it is, I''d like to have seen more of the flame and maybe less of the bottom background gray.  But it''s a very creditable entry.  Keep up the good work.', '2004-02-19 11:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(588072, 60502, 14476, '<td valign="top">I very much like the justaposition of the rock and the falls.  The various textures of the water are also interesting, especially with the rock acting as a foil.</td>', 'I very much like the justaposition of the rock and the falls.  The various textures of the water are also interesting, especially with the rock acting as a foil.', '2004-02-19 11:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(588075, 60010, 11895, '<td valign="top">I think I may have seen this somewhere before</td>', 'I think I may have seen this somewhere before', '2004-02-19 11:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
