(589414, 60421, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you the challenge on the title and subject of the piece of sculpture that you are shooting.  However, your colors are very dull (levels?) and you appear to be overexposed in her white dress and she appears to be tilted to the left.  Also your focus is a little off.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''ll give you the challenge on the title and subject of the piece of sculpture that you are shooting.  However, your colors are very dull (levels?) and you appear to be overexposed in her white dress and she appears to be tilted to the left.  Also your focus is a little off.TC', '2004-02-19 22:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
