(589590, 60154, 3540, '<td valign="top">Quality just isn''t here with this photograph.  Doesn''t look like the best day to do this shot either.</td>', 'Quality just isn''t here with this photograph.  Doesn''t look like the best day to do this shot either.', '2004-02-19 23:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
