(589612, 60607, 3540, '<td valign="top">This needs a little more dramatic lighting or something to give it a little spark, pardon the pun.  Its not as clear as it should be either.  I think actually having the fire in here and speeding up the shutter a bit would better represent this grate and fireplace.</td>', 'This needs a little more dramatic lighting or something to give it a little spark, pardon the pun.  Its not as clear as it should be either.  I think actually having the fire in here and speeding up the shutter a bit would better represent this grate and fireplace.', '2004-02-20 00:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(589613, 59564, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the shot to a point, but the shot is so head on, dead center.... I''d like to see this differently.  I think it could do well.</td>', 'I like the shot to a point, but the shot is so head on, dead center.... I''d like to see this differently.  I think it could do well.', '2004-02-20 00:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(589614, 60427, 3540, '<td valign="top">HOT HOT HOT.  I think that really says it all.  This needs to be taken like 2 or 3 stops down.  Show some of the colors of the scene.  Dreary doesn''t equate to boring, but you really have to do it right to get the effect the voters are looking for.</td>', 'HOT HOT HOT.  I think that really says it all.  This needs to be taken like 2 or 3 stops down.  Show some of the colors of the scene.  Dreary doesn''t equate to boring, but you really have to do it right to get the effect the voters are looking for.', '2004-02-20 00:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(589615, 60371, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent reflections and patterns in the reflections.  Nice job with this shot and good luck.</td>', 'Excellent reflections and patterns in the reflections.  Nice job with this shot and good luck.', '2004-02-20 00:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(589617, 60001, 3540, '<td valign="top">The large black area in the bottom right really throws the balance of this photo off and breaks the conitinuity established by the flame.  Great colors and action in the flames.  With something else on the bottom to add a little more interest and a little less plain black, I think you could get away with having something on the bottom.</td>', 'The large black area in the bottom right really throws the balance of this photo off and breaks the conitinuity established by the flame.  Great colors and action in the flames.  With something else on the bottom to add a little more interest and a little less plain black, I think you could get away with having something on the bottom.', '2004-02-20 00:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(589619, 60605, 3540, '<td valign="top">The puddle is really hot.  The foreground is pretty dark.  A hard combination of scenarios to shoot together in the same picture without messing either one or both up.  i think you did the right thing here as far as doing what you had to do, but I dont'' think it has the strong visual appeal that we''re looking for.  Nice peaceful shot nonetheless</td>', 'The puddle is really hot.  The foreground is pretty dark.  A hard combination of scenarios to shoot together in the same picture without messing either one or both up.  i think you did the right thing here as far as doing what you had to do, but I dont'' think it has the strong visual appeal that we''re looking for.  Nice peaceful shot nonetheless', '2004-02-20 00:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(589623, 59496, 3540, '<td valign="top">Well framed, for the size of the shot.  The aspect ratio is a little strange it seems to me any way.  But its a pretty nice job, especially with the framing of it.</td>', 'Well framed, for the size of the shot.  The aspect ratio is a little strange it seems to me any way.  But its a pretty nice job, especially with the framing of it.', '2004-02-20 00:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(589627, 60582, 3540, '<td valign="top">Your horizon seems to be running uphill a bit from left to right.  The seagulls are too far away to make a case that they are part of the subject matter.</td>', 'Your horizon seems to be running uphill a bit from left to right.  The seagulls are too far away to make a case that they are part of the subject matter.', '2004-02-20 00:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(589630, 60567, 3540, '<td valign="top">The front stuff in the middle to lower right is really compelling.  Nice job exposing this properly and an all around good capture.   This is a cool picture.</td>', 'The front stuff in the middle to lower right is really compelling.  Nice job exposing this properly and an all around good capture.   This is a cool picture.', '2004-02-20 00:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(589632, 60194, 3540, '<td valign="top">this seems just a little underexposed and maybe not lit quite as well as it could be.  Good picture, but I think reaching a little for this challenge.</td>', 'this seems just a little underexposed and maybe not lit quite as well as it could be.  Good picture, but I think reaching a little for this challenge.', '2004-02-20 00:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(589642, 60459, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is stunning. The clarity of the image is just fantastic, and the elements come through loud and clear! 10</td>', 'This is stunning. The clarity of the image is just fantastic, and the elements come through loud and clear! 10', '2004-02-20 00:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(589643, 60505, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is very moody.  Looks like a tornado is on the way or somehting.  I love it!</td>', 'This is very moody.  Looks like a tornado is on the way or somehting.  I love it!', '2004-02-20 00:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(589646, 60255, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice  journalistic image. Composition is very effective, and the tonal range and colors are very nice indeed!</td>', 'Very nice  journalistic image. Composition is very effective, and the tonal range and colors are very nice indeed!', '2004-02-20 00:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(589681, 60254, 15360, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorite photographs in this challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'This was one of my favorite photographs in this challenge.  Well done!', '2004-02-20 01:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(589761, 60427, 7151, '<td valign="top">My first thought is:  the two primary elements represented - water and air - are washed out to the point that they''re indistinct in the shot.  Not sure if there''s a purpose behind that...</td>', 'My first thought is:  the two primary elements represented - water and air - are washed out to the point that they''re indistinct in the shot.  Not sure if there''s a purpose behind that...', '2004-02-20 03:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(589762, 60530, 7151, '<td valign="top">The slight off-kilter tilt gives it a snapshoty feel.  I think a little closer on one of the burgers with the flame wrapping around it would have been a bit more meaningful.  Good capture of the flame though.</td>', 'The slight off-kilter tilt gives it a snapshoty feel.  I think a little closer on one of the burgers with the flame wrapping around it would have been a bit more meaningful.  Good capture of the flame though.', '2004-02-20 03:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(589763, 59975, 7151, '<td valign="top">Very interesting contrast.  Usually you expect darker rocks on ligher, reflective water.  Makes you take a second look.  Nice.</td>', 'Very interesting contrast.  Usually you expect darker rocks on ligher, reflective water.  Makes you take a second look.  Nice.', '2004-02-20 03:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(589764, 60516, 7151, '<td valign="top">A more organic form for the ice would have given more depth to the image.</td>', 'A more organic form for the ice would have given more depth to the image.', '2004-02-20 03:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(589768, 60616, 7151, '<td valign="top">The best fit I could find without spending so much time as to deny other photos consideration was this:  //www.newage-directory.com/fount.html.  Close?  Juxtaposition, yielding and firm.  I suppose I can see that, though not convincingly so.  Lighting and background seem to conspire to draw my attention to much from the main subject.  I''m curious which came first in this instance: did you envision this image and seek it out, or did you observe the scene and draw the inspiration from that?  Not sure that it matters - each has it''s place - just curious.</td>', 'The best fit I could find without spending so much time as to deny other photos consideration was this:  //www.newage-directory.com/fount.html.  Close?  Juxtaposition, yielding and firm.  I suppose I can see that, though not convincingly so.  Lighting and background seem to conspire to draw my attention to much from the main subject.  I''m curious which came first in this instance: did you envision this image and seek it out, or did you observe the scene and draw the inspiration from that?  Not sure that it matters - each has it''s place - just curious.', '2004-02-20 03:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(589771, 59740, 7151, '<td valign="top">The choice is yours.  "Turn or burn", as they say.  But maybe I misunderstand...<br/> <br/>Visually odd.  The technique is somehow distracting - whatever that is at or around your neck appears pasted in.  I''m not saying I think you did something illegal, I''m saying that whatever you did to process this image created the same effect as a bad paste, and that mars the overall image for me.</td>', 'The choice is yours.  "Turn or burn", as they say.  But maybe I misunderstand... Visually odd.  The technique is somehow distracting - whatever that is at or around your neck appears pasted in.  I''m not saying I think you did something illegal, I''m saying that whatever you did to process this image created the same effect as a bad paste, and that mars the overall image for me.', '2004-02-20 03:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(589772, 60396, 7151, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would have worked better (assuming you had the option to play with.  The trees at the top, particularly the near-center one, are distracting and don''t add anything to the theme.</td>', 'A tighter crop would have worked better (assuming you had the option to play with.  The trees at the top, particularly the near-center one, are distracting and don''t add anything to the theme.', '2004-02-20 03:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(589773, 60271, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Woulda been cool if you had better clouds - the effect of a cloud cupped in the palm of the hand.  Might be worth revisiting this statue some time.  I like the curves and the contrasts of stone to sky, dark agains the light blue.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Woulda been cool if you had better clouds - the effect of a cloud cupped in the palm of the hand.  Might be worth revisiting this statue some time.  I like the curves and the contrasts of stone to sky, dark agains the light blue.', '2004-02-20 03:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(589774, 60522, 7151, '<td valign="top">Upside down?</td>', 'Upside down?', '2004-02-20 03:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(589777, 60045, 7151, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.  Best fire &amp; ice shot I''ve seen so far in the challenge.  The melting water has that Terminator 2 liquid metal feel.  Trying to decide if there''s something intentional hiden in some of the reflections...</td>', 'Very, very nice.  Best fire & ice shot I''ve seen so far in the challenge.  The melting water has that Terminator 2 liquid metal feel.  Trying to decide if there''s something intentional hiden in some of the reflections...', '2004-02-20 03:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(589779, 60156, 7151, '<td valign="top">Tighter crop or zoom on the brighter section of the photo might have worked a bit better.</td>', 'Tighter crop or zoom on the brighter section of the photo might have worked a bit better.', '2004-02-20 03:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(589790, 59999, 4258, '<td valign="top">A curving backdrop instead of a sharp one would be better here</td>', 'A curving backdrop instead of a sharp one would be better here', '2004-02-20 04:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(589849, 60001, 17477, '<td valign="top">Not something i would hang on my wall...but a dramatic snap that captures the eye.</td>', 'Not something i would hang on my wall...but a dramatic snap that captures the eye.', '2004-02-20 05:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(589913, 59649, 1368, '<td valign="top">Always cool to see things through waterdrops, The light in the drop is a bit distracting flash or something, and I think the picture could be cropped a little better, anyway good luck :)</td>', 'Always cool to see things through waterdrops, The light in the drop is a bit distracting flash or something, and I think the picture could be cropped a little better, anyway good luck :)', '2004-02-20 06:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(589924, 60267, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shape of the impact here :) Nice colors in it  too, I think there should be a bit more space on the right or mabey something different in the cropping, I like the reflections in the ring But I think the picture itself is a little flat , mabey something to do with the cropping or lightning dont know :) Good luck :)</td>', 'Beautiful shape of the impact here :) Nice colors in it  too, I think there should be a bit more space on the right or mabey something different in the cropping, I like the reflections in the ring But I think the picture itself is a little flat , mabey something to do with the cropping or lightning dont know :) Good luck :)', '2004-02-20 06:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(589931, 60638, 1368, '<td valign="top">Anic try of this technic The colors look good But you should try too keep the drops in focus, good luck :)</td>', 'Anic try of this technic The colors look good But you should try too keep the drops in focus, good luck :)', '2004-02-20 06:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(589934, 60266, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, great colors good cropping, and great to have this as the lightning I like it alot :) Good luck</td>', 'Beautiful shot, great colors good cropping, and great to have this as the lightning I like it alot :) Good luck', '2004-02-20 06:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(589944, 60329, 1368, '<td valign="top">This picture is rather flat, not much going on the besides a lonely burned up cigarette, it could look better with a different lightning and in bit sharper focus, good luck :)</td>', 'This picture is rather flat, not much going on the besides a lonely burned up cigarette, it could look better with a different lightning and in bit sharper focus, good luck :)', '2004-02-20 06:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(589947, 60459, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape shot. Composition is interesting with the land and the beautiful reflections in the water. The hues in the sky is great. A tiny bit of cropping on the bottom of the shot would help to make for a better composition. A tiny bit of dodging on the left to bring out some of the rocks to equal the lighting on the ones on the right would give a better feeling. "9"</td>', 'Beautiful landscape shot. Composition is interesting with the land and the beautiful reflections in the water. The hues in the sky is great. A tiny bit of cropping on the bottom of the shot would help to make for a better composition. A tiny bit of dodging on the left to bring out some of the rocks to equal the lighting on the ones on the right would give a better feeling. "9"', '2004-02-20 06:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(589949, 60194, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful emotional picture, the soft focus is wonderful and the black and white, very strong picture. ps. I hope he´s not eating the rat???</td>', 'Beautiful emotional picture, the soft focus is wonderful and the black and white, very strong picture. ps. I hope he´s not eating the rat???', '2004-02-20 06:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(589964, 59567, 1368, '<td valign="top">you could work on the lightning on this one Seems to me the light comes from behind the glass and overexposures the bottom of the glass, and leaves the middle of the glass in some kind of a fog, could also work on the background, the thing in the upper left corner could work with this picture but the thing to the right behind the glass is distracting from the glass, you might also want to lose the tissue and clean the glass, Anyway good luck :-)</td>', 'you could work on the lightning on this one Seems to me the light comes from behind the glass and overexposures the bottom of the glass, and leaves the middle of the glass in some kind of a fog, could also work on the background, the thing in the upper left corner could work with this picture but the thing to the right behind the glass is distracting from the glass, you might also want to lose the tissue and clean the glass, Anyway good luck :-)', '2004-02-20 07:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(589968, 60427, 1368, '<td valign="top">I guess you over leveled this ine As the sky and the river are all overexposured and the forrest just black, I think this photo would have looked just great with some colors in it, Good luck :)</td>', 'I guess you over leveled this ine As the sky and the river are all overexposured and the forrest just black, I think this photo would have looked just great with some colors in it, Good luck :)', '2004-02-20 07:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(590286, 60490, 17330, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and mood</td>', 'Great perspective and mood', '2004-02-20 09:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(590290, 60455, 17330, '<td valign="top">Great mood and composition</td>', 'Great mood and composition', '2004-02-20 09:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(590310, 60489, 9982, '<td valign="top">I think this would be so much better if the horizon were level.</td>', 'I think this would be so much better if the horizon were level.', '2004-02-20 10:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(590348, 60175, 12733, '<td valign="top">Really nice - the shutter speed is just slow enough to create a sheet of water but not so slow as to make it look like snow. The texture on the rocks comes through really well, and the figure at the bottom shows the scale of the falls.</td>', 'Really nice - the shutter speed is just slow enough to create a sheet of water but not so slow as to make it look like snow. The texture on the rocks comes through really well, and the figure at the bottom shows the scale of the falls.', '2004-02-20 10:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(590349, 60131, 12733, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and reflections, and great DOF.</td>', 'Lovely colors and reflections, and great DOF.', '2004-02-20 10:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(590354, 60640, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, using the colors of sunset to show air, which is normally invisible (in fact the clouds are water, but who''s complaining? I think somewhat less black at the bottom of the photo would bring the sky out even better.</td>', 'Nice idea, using the colors of sunset to show air, which is normally invisible (in fact the clouds are water, but who''s complaining? I think somewhat less black at the bottom of the photo would bring the sky out even better.', '2004-02-20 10:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(590358, 60581, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the result is kind of bland. I think you needed a stormier day to get some clouds in the sky and whitecaps on the water.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the result is kind of bland. I think you needed a stormier day to get some clouds in the sky and whitecaps on the water.', '2004-02-20 10:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(590362, 60567, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast between the snow and water; each sets the other off.</td>', 'Beautiful contrast between the snow and water; each sets the other off.', '2004-02-20 10:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(590364, 60266, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the shape of flames, the colors and the metallic sheen below the flame.</td>', 'Great capture of the shape of flames, the colors and the metallic sheen below the flame.', '2004-02-20 10:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590366, 60616, 12733, '<td valign="top">The foreground tree, vines and ferns is beautiful. The background is neither sharp enough to add to the picture nor blurred enough to ignore - it really detracts from the effect.</td>', 'The foreground tree, vines and ferns is beautiful. The background is neither sharp enough to add to the picture nor blurred enough to ignore - it really detracts from the effect.', '2004-02-20 10:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(590370, 59496, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute. I might have cropped him a bit tighter, as the snow doesn''t really add much.</td>', 'Very cute. I might have cropped him a bit tighter, as the snow doesn''t really add much.', '2004-02-20 10:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(590373, 60146, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful landscape that conjures up memories of an earlier era. I really like the fog obscuring the other windmills and the sheep. The colors are really outstanding.</td>', 'This is a beautiful landscape that conjures up memories of an earlier era. I really like the fog obscuring the other windmills and the sheep. The colors are really outstanding.', '2004-02-20 10:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(590375, 60369, 12733, '<td valign="top">The branches against the clouds gives a true three dimensional effect.</td>', 'The branches against the clouds gives a true three dimensional effect.', '2004-02-20 10:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(590377, 60666, 12733, '<td valign="top">Needs better DOF, I think.</td>', 'Needs better DOF, I think.', '2004-02-20 10:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(590380, 59936, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect, but the photo seems gimmicky to me.</td>', 'An interesting effect, but the photo seems gimmicky to me.', '2004-02-20 10:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(590384, 60654, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty sky colors and nice composition.</td>', 'Very pretty sky colors and nice composition.', '2004-02-20 10:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(590388, 60357, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and textures in the rocks nd the "reality" of the water - not always easy to capture.</td>', 'I like the colors and textures in the rocks nd the "reality" of the water - not always easy to capture.', '2004-02-20 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(590391, 60605, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the sun behind the trees and the lacy feel of the branches. Very nice color in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice capture of the sun behind the trees and the lacy feel of the branches. Very nice color in the foreground.', '2004-02-20 10:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(590397, 60427, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but way too much contrast. Much of the water is blank white, and the background trees run together in a black blur. Possibly taking the shot on a less bright day with light diffused through clouds would reduce the tonal range and get some detail into the highlights and shadows.</td>', 'Nice composition, but way too much contrast. Much of the water is blank white, and the background trees run together in a black blur. Possibly taking the shot on a less bright day with light diffused through clouds would reduce the tonal range and get some detail into the highlights and shadows.', '2004-02-20 10:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590402, 59913, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is this really a volcano? How did you get it without being burnt to a crisp? Nice colors, good composition.</td>', 'Is this really a volcano? How did you get it without being burnt to a crisp? Nice colors, good composition.', '2004-02-20 10:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(590405, 60530, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the appearance of fire, and the refelctions off the meat add a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice capture of the appearance of fire, and the refelctions off the meat add a nice touch.', '2004-02-20 10:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(590407, 60376, 12733, '<td valign="top">The placement of the figure turns what could be a very mundane seascape into an interesting composition and gives a sense of the scale of the beach and ocean.</td>', 'The placement of the figure turns what could be a very mundane seascape into an interesting composition and gives a sense of the scale of the beach and ocean.', '2004-02-20 10:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590409, 60587, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of foreground elements to frame the shot and give a feeling of containment to the water. The hot spot in the right background is an unfortunate distraction.</td>', 'Nice use of foreground elements to frame the shot and give a feeling of containment to the water. The hot spot in the right background is an unfortunate distraction.', '2004-02-20 10:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(590411, 60136, 12733, '<td valign="top">Many subjects work better in black and white, but IMHO sunrises and sunsets are not among them. I can imagine beautiful colors in the sky, and their reflections on the water, but I''d like to see them.</td>', 'Many subjects work better in black and white, but IMHO sunrises and sunsets are not among them. I can imagine beautiful colors in the sky, and their reflections on the water, but I''d like to see them.', '2004-02-20 10:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(590412, 60635, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the sense of motion and the joy of a kid with a kite.</td>', 'Nice capture of the sense of motion and the joy of a kid with a kite.', '2004-02-20 10:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(590416, 60505, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of the texture of the earth. I also like the sun''s rays breaking through the clouds (water). This picture works well in black and white.</td>', 'Nice sense of the texture of the earth. I also like the sun''s rays breaking through the clouds (water). This picture works well in black and white.', '2004-02-20 10:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(590419, 59965, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and pretty colors, but it seems somehow flat to me.</td>', 'Nice idea and pretty colors, but it seems somehow flat to me.', '2004-02-20 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(590420, 60254, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty lamps, and you''ve captured the texture of the glass beautifully.</td>', 'Very pretty lamps, and you''ve captured the texture of the glass beautifully.', '2004-02-20 11:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(590423, 60197, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - good colors, nice composition. But that water does look kind of calm for a "battle."</td>', 'Nice shot - good colors, nice composition. But that water does look kind of calm for a "battle."', '2004-02-20 11:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(590424, 60699, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in textures between the structure and the water below. Is this a dam?</td>', 'Nice contrast in textures between the structure and the water below. Is this a dam?', '2004-02-20 11:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(590427, 60397, 12733, '<td valign="top">The boat is a pretty color, and the branches show nice texture. But somehow, the combination just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The boat is a pretty color, and the branches show nice texture. But somehow, the combination just doesn''t work for me.', '2004-02-20 11:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590428, 59568, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the muted colors and the lacy texture of the tree branches.</td>', 'I like the muted colors and the lacy texture of the tree branches.', '2004-02-20 11:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590429, 60175, 15982, '<td valign="top">I think that the picture would have been better minus the human element. Great Waterfall! The person definitely gives a better idea of how big it really is though. But, to me, the size of the waterfall is irrelevant as it is a truly magnificent one.</td>', 'I think that the picture would have been better minus the human element. Great Waterfall! The person definitely gives a better idea of how big it really is though. But, to me, the size of the waterfall is irrelevant as it is a truly magnificent one.', '2004-02-20 11:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(590430, 60509, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and nice capture of the blue and red of the flame. But the bright part of the flame is too bright - it dominates the picture. Could stand a bit more yellow and a bit less brightness.</td>', 'Nice idea, and nice capture of the blue and red of the flame. But the bright part of the flame is too bright - it dominates the picture. Could stand a bit more yellow and a bit less brightness.', '2004-02-20 11:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(590431, 59722, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I''d like to see more detail in the foreground trees.</td>', 'Nice composition. I''d like to see more detail in the foreground trees.', '2004-02-20 11:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(590432, 59909, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture and color in the rocks - a nice contrast to the golf ball.</td>', 'Very nice texture and color in the rocks - a nice contrast to the golf ball.', '2004-02-20 11:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(590543, 60251, 3447, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge.   Try a series of shots with increasing shutter speeds to see if you get a better sense of falling water as your eye sees it.</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge.   Try a series of shots with increasing shutter speeds to see if you get a better sense of falling water as your eye sees it.', '2004-02-20 12:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(590545, 60644, 3447, '<td valign="top">Dramatic!  Good eye for composition.   This photograph will get a high number.</td>', 'Dramatic!  Good eye for composition.   This photograph will get a high number.', '2004-02-20 12:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(590549, 59787, 3447, '<td valign="top">Good concept, well photographed.    Nitpick - bright light spots on right hand side of glasses.</td>', 'Good concept, well photographed.    Nitpick - bright light spots on right hand side of glasses.', '2004-02-20 12:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(590553, 60652, 3447, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and pretty flower.   Purists will say the element earth should have been more sharply focused.</td>', 'Nice idea, and pretty flower.   Purists will say the element earth should have been more sharply focused.', '2004-02-20 12:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(590593, 59985, 16126, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I like how you captured the colors in the clouds. Nice composition also, with the one windmill towering over the others.</td>', 'Great shot, I like how you captured the colors in the clouds. Nice composition also, with the one windmill towering over the others.', '2004-02-20 13:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(590597, 60136, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The middle part seems a bit overexposed?</td>', 'Nice composition. The middle part seems a bit overexposed?', '2004-02-20 13:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(590598, 59568, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice atmosphere. Composition would have been better if the island were not smack in the middle, otherwise a nice picture</td>', 'Nice atmosphere. Composition would have been better if the island were not smack in the middle, otherwise a nice picture', '2004-02-20 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(590601, 59496, 16126, '<td valign="top">Too bad this is a bit grainy, and that the snow in the middle seems overexposed. Otherwise, good composition and great capture.</td>', 'Too bad this is a bit grainy, and that the snow in the middle seems overexposed. Otherwise, good composition and great capture.', '2004-02-20 13:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(590611, 60678, 16126, '<td valign="top">The color of the falling water and of the ice is incredible! The wall on the left and the red gate seem to distract a bit.</td>', 'The color of the falling water and of the ice is incredible! The wall on the left and the red gate seem to distract a bit.', '2004-02-20 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(590666, 60357, 16126, '<td valign="top">Impressive picture!</td>', 'Impressive picture!', '2004-02-20 13:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(590730, 60491, 17291, '<td valign="top">Great photo!</td>', 'Great photo!', '2004-02-20 14:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(590792, 60020, 7889, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this very much, I love the colour of the sky and the shadow cast by the cloth, but the building in the background detracts from the main subject. Nice photo</td>', 'I like the idea of this very much, I love the colour of the sky and the shadow cast by the cloth, but the building in the background detracts from the main subject. Nice photo', '2004-02-20 14:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(590800, 60427, 7889, '<td valign="top">I like strong contrasting subjects, no doubt some will say ''its harsh'', overexposed etc. Never mind they are still some people who will appreciate this. thanks<br/></td>', 'I like strong contrasting subjects, no doubt some will say ''its harsh'', overexposed etc. Never mind they are still some people who will appreciate this. thanks', '2004-02-20 14:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(590811, 60046, 4207, '<td valign="top">NIce job of Foreground, Middle ground, and background.</td>', 'NIce job of Foreground, Middle ground, and background.', '2004-02-20 14:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(590824, 60641, 7889, '<td valign="top">I like the burned out effect of the flame very much, the platform that the candle stands on spoils this a little.</td>', 'I like the burned out effect of the flame very much, the platform that the candle stands on spoils this a little.', '2004-02-20 14:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(590829, 60502, 7889, '<td valign="top">good effect, a little stronger contrast would have helped with this but its a good shot</td>', 'good effect, a little stronger contrast would have helped with this but its a good shot', '2004-02-20 15:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(590877, 60490, 16478, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting on the church. Nice shot. 7</td>', 'Beautiful lighting on the church. Nice shot. 7', '2004-02-20 15:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(590883, 59568, 12813, '<td valign="top">Totally beautiful</td>', 'Totally beautiful', '2004-02-20 15:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(590892, 60357, 16957, '<td valign="top">An effective image with a raw energy that fits the challenge well. technically, I might have either taken this with a fast shutter and frozen all the water OR a slow speed and made it all smooth. You perhaps did not have the choice given that it was a bright day but a minor point is that the fuzy water middle left appears out of context to the rest of the action. Minor though. Well observed</td>', 'An effective image with a raw energy that fits the challenge well. technically, I might have either taken this with a fast shutter and frozen all the water OR a slow speed and made it all smooth. You perhaps did not have the choice given that it was a bright day but a minor point is that the fuzy water middle left appears out of context to the rest of the action. Minor though. Well observed', '2004-02-20 16:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(590899, 60683, 16957, '<td valign="top">I think this is a kite? A tricky shot to capture so well done but I would have liked to feel more powerfully the element you were portraying - air. There is little movement or feel for it. For all the viewere knows this might have been shot against a carpet or something.</td>', 'I think this is a kite? A tricky shot to capture so well done but I would have liked to feel more powerfully the element you were portraying - air. There is little movement or feel for it. For all the viewere knows this might have been shot against a carpet or something.', '2004-02-20 16:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(590904, 60351, 16957, '<td valign="top">Well composed and attractive lighting give this a stark and elemental feel. Buildings are a pity but difficult to avoid (shallow depth of field focusing on tree might have helped?)</td>', 'Well composed and attractive lighting give this a stark and elemental feel. Buildings are a pity but difficult to avoid (shallow depth of field focusing on tree might have helped?)', '2004-02-20 16:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(590907, 60671, 16957, '<td valign="top">Good isea and cleverly executed.</td>', 'Good isea and cleverly executed.', '2004-02-20 16:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(590911, 59740, 16957, '<td valign="top">I took some time to absorb this image. I like it but unsure how it fits the challenge.</td>', 'I took some time to absorb this image. I like it but unsure how it fits the challenge.', '2004-02-20 16:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(590925, 59722, 11899, '<td valign="top">I really like this one..quite beautiful</td>', 'I really like this one..quite beautiful', '2004-02-20 16:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(590976, 59787, 6405, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is a joke,but to be 100 % literal is totaly insane IMHO,good luck !</td>', 'I don''t know if this is a joke,but to be 100 % literal is totaly insane IMHO,good luck !', '2004-02-20 16:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(590977, 60371, 6405, '<td valign="top">I would cut those branches on the top and leave just the reflected painting on the water,awesome capture,10 from me!</td>', 'I would cut those branches on the top and leave just the reflected painting on the water,awesome capture,10 from me!', '2004-02-20 16:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(590978, 60587, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape,9 from me !</td>', 'Beautiful landscape,9 from me !', '2004-02-20 16:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(590979, 59876, 6405, '<td valign="top">Lovely ,10 !</td>', 'Lovely ,10 !', '2004-02-20 16:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(590980, 60491, 6405, '<td valign="top">:ooks like Ice cream,10 !</td>', ':ooks like Ice cream,10 !', '2004-02-20 16:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(590981, 59994, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ,10 !</td>', 'Beautiful ,10 !', '2004-02-20 16:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(591011, 60427, 4400, '<td valign="top">Over exposed!</td>', 'Over exposed!', '2004-02-20 17:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(591018, 59876, 4400, '<td valign="top">it''s like the boat is in heaven! nice one</td>', 'it''s like the boat is in heaven! nice one', '2004-02-20 17:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(591033, 60491, 4400, '<td valign="top">lovely photo 10</td>', 'lovely photo 10', '2004-02-20 17:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(591059, 60505, 4400, '<td valign="top">are the sky rea?l (no photoshop) good job! top 3- 10pt</td>', 'are the sky rea?l (no photoshop) good job! top 3- 10pt', '2004-02-20 18:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(591089, 60179, 2158, '<td valign="top">Just wondering if there was any way to make the background less noticeable - shallow depth of field perhaps?  Or maybe a different angle?  The frog looks really good.</td>', 'Just wondering if there was any way to make the background less noticeable - shallow depth of field perhaps?  Or maybe a different angle?  The frog looks really good.', '2004-02-20 18:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(591126, 60179, 14837, '<td valign="top">This is really neat!  It looks like it''s about to hop off the picture!</td>', 'This is really neat!  It looks like it''s about to hop off the picture!', '2004-02-20 18:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(591129, 59985, 14837, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!', '2004-02-20 18:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(591130, 59722, 14837, '<td valign="top">This photo has a great and beautiful softness to it!  I really like the feeling of the picture too!  Nice job!</td>', 'This photo has a great and beautiful softness to it!  I really like the feeling of the picture too!  Nice job!', '2004-02-20 18:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(591132, 60520, 14837, '<td valign="top">Very creative and nicely done!</td>', 'Very creative and nicely done!', '2004-02-20 18:38:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(591133, 60491, 14837, '<td valign="top">This is stunning!  It makes me want to be standing right there taking it all in!  Great color and focus!  Wonderful!</td>', 'This is stunning!  It makes me want to be standing right there taking it all in!  Great color and focus!  Wonderful!', '2004-02-20 18:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(591134, 60652, 14837, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, great focus on the flower... just a nice shot all around!</td>', 'Nice DOF, great focus on the flower... just a nice shot all around!', '2004-02-20 18:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(591138, 60146, 14837, '<td valign="top">I really like how calming this photo is.  It makes me wnt to be there.</td>', 'I really like how calming this photo is.  It makes me wnt to be there.', '2004-02-20 18:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(591155, 59994, 8860, '<td valign="top">Intriguing sense of scale with good composition.</td>', 'Intriguing sense of scale with good composition.', '2004-02-20 18:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(591159, 60567, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good focus &amp; DOF and lovely, fresh subject. It''s a slight shame about the intrusion of a man made object in the scene, but that''s nit-picking.</td>', 'Good focus & DOF and lovely, fresh subject. It''s a slight shame about the intrusion of a man made object in the scene, but that''s nit-picking.', '2004-02-20 18:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(591161, 60154, 13513, '<td valign="top">Awful quality</td>', 'Awful quality', '2004-02-20 19:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(591162, 60175, 8860, '<td valign="top">Incredible, humbling sense of scale in this rugged scene. Well composed too. Love it. [10]</td>', 'Incredible, humbling sense of scale in this rugged scene. Well composed too. Love it. [10]', '2004-02-20 19:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(591167, 60582, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene of what looks like a wonderful part of the world. <br/> <br/>Horizon is seemingly a touch skewed and the birds are too small to play a useful part in the composition, making it look cluttered.</td>', 'Lovely scene of what looks like a wonderful part of the world.  Horizon is seemingly a touch skewed and the birds are too small to play a useful part in the composition, making it look cluttered.', '2004-02-20 19:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(591170, 60479, 8860, '<td valign="top">I see what you''re getting at here and I think you''ve largely pulled it off, but I think you could have made this look even more ''sexy'' with a reclining composition! The leaf texture really does look like skin - excellent.</td>', 'I see what you''re getting at here and I think you''ve largely pulled it off, but I think you could have made this look even more ''sexy'' with a reclining composition! The leaf texture really does look like skin - excellent.', '2004-02-20 19:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(591172, 60491, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject but the shot looks a little over-treated to me. The trees are unsually off-vertical which suggests that this is either a skewed shot of a slope or it''s a very windy place?</td>', 'Beautiful subject but the shot looks a little over-treated to me. The trees are unsually off-vertical which suggests that this is either a skewed shot of a slope or it''s a very windy place?', '2004-02-20 19:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(591175, 60459, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely time of day and great subject. I''d like to see some more foreground or none at all as there is just not enough of it. Sky is serene and detail is excellent. Shadowed area on left is a bit too heavy. [8]</td>', 'Lovely time of day and great subject. I''d like to see some more foreground or none at all as there is just not enough of it. Sky is serene and detail is excellent. Shadowed area on left is a bit too heavy. [8]', '2004-02-20 19:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(591178, 60652, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well it would have been genesis if you hadn''t dug the poor thing up!! It''s nemesis now.<br/> <br/>Nice shot though, but it looks a little over-treated for my taste and I''m not convinced by the composition.</td>', 'Well it would have been genesis if you hadn''t dug the poor thing up!! It''s nemesis now. Nice shot though, but it looks a little over-treated for my taste and I''m not convinced by the composition.', '2004-02-20 19:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(591186, 60605, 8860, '<td valign="top">I love this a lot. I like the rich colour and lighting, but the composition and distractions bother me. Since this was an editing challenge I would have retouched the building on the left and the branch in the foreground on the right. [7]</td>', 'I love this a lot. I like the rich colour and lighting, but the composition and distractions bother me. Since this was an editing challenge I would have retouched the building on the left and the branch in the foreground on the right. [7]', '2004-02-20 19:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(591317, 60234, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast the reflection is great  7</td>', 'I like the contrast the reflection is great  7', '2004-02-20 20:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(591322, 60131, 6597, '<td valign="top">good reflection and color 8</td>', 'good reflection and color 8', '2004-02-20 21:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(591324, 59985, 6597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colo7</td>', 'Beautiful colo7', '2004-02-20 21:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(591497, 59862, 2333, '<td valign="top">This si such a beautiful abstract, and very shar; would have been helped by bringing the longest side up to 640 px. Still very nice work.</td>', 'This si such a beautiful abstract, and very shar; would have been helped by bringing the longest side up to 640 px. Still very nice work.', '2004-02-20 23:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(591504, 59884, 2333, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, nice sharp image. Very nice capture of both birds with wings high, even looking in the same direction.<br/>You really have a photo with great potential here. You need to bring in the black and white points (levels) and tweak contrast a bit. You could sharpen just a bit more after the resize as well.</td>', 'Very nice composition, nice sharp image. Very nice capture of both birds with wings high, even looking in the same direction.You really have a photo with great potential here. You need to bring in the black and white points (levels) and tweak contrast a bit. You could sharpen just a bit more after the resize as well.', '2004-02-20 23:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(591520, 59876, 2333, '<td valign="top">Superb. Love the choice of composition, exposure, the choice of B+W. My firs-place choice. Good work and good luck.</td>', 'Superb. Love the choice of composition, exposure, the choice of B+W. My firs-place choice. Good work and good luck.', '2004-02-20 23:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(591651, 60285, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful!  really nice tone and composition.</td>', 'beautiful!  really nice tone and composition.', '2004-02-21 01:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(591656, 59834, 3540, '<td valign="top">Yucky sky never makes for good pictures.  Framing was appropriate to minimize it, but it never goes away.  Needs some color for visual impact.</td>', 'Yucky sky never makes for good pictures.  Framing was appropriate to minimize it, but it never goes away.  Needs some color for visual impact.', '2004-02-21 01:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(591658, 60382, 3540, '<td valign="top">Title is too long.  Looks like you have some little while specks around the bottom of the glass.  The color added in is pretty vibrant but why not use a more colorful flower too?  Just curious</td>', 'Title is too long.  Looks like you have some little while specks around the bottom of the glass.  The color added in is pretty vibrant but why not use a more colorful flower too?  Just curious', '2004-02-21 01:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(591661, 59736, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  I normally like the skies really blue, but the darker sky adds some contrast to the water.   Needs something to provide a little more impact and give a definite focal point.</td>', 'Good photo.  I normally like the skies really blue, but the darker sky adds some contrast to the water.   Needs something to provide a little more impact and give a definite focal point.', '2004-02-21 01:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(591664, 60264, 3540, '<td valign="top">The diagonal line cuttng the photo is great.  Good stuff on the bottom half of the photo.   The top half I''d like to see in straight lines or really messed up where there appears to be no lines.  The composition needs it to be ordered, or contrasting with the patterns methinks.  I love the idea and its very good, but doesn''t have exactly what I''m looking for 8</td>', 'The diagonal line cuttng the photo is great.  Good stuff on the bottom half of the photo.   The top half I''d like to see in straight lines or really messed up where there appears to be no lines.  The composition needs it to be ordered, or contrasting with the patterns methinks.  I love the idea and its very good, but doesn''t have exactly what I''m looking for 8', '2004-02-21 01:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(591667, 59862, 3540, '<td valign="top">THis needs to be bigger so we can see what''s going on.  the crop should be a little tighter too so there is minimal bare black space in the composition.  Great subject for a macro tho</td>', 'THis needs to be bigger so we can see what''s going on.  the crop should be a little tighter too so there is minimal bare black space in the composition.  Great subject for a macro tho', '2004-02-21 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(591668, 59985, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good framing, awesome color.  I like this photo a lot for this challenge.  It really concentrates on one of the four elements and doesn''t try to cram 2 down my throat.  Great sharp silhouettes and a good theme and mood 9</td>', 'Good framing, awesome color.  I like this photo a lot for this challenge.  It really concentrates on one of the four elements and doesn''t try to cram 2 down my throat.  Great sharp silhouettes and a good theme and mood 9', '2004-02-21 01:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(591669, 59776, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject, but its a little too straightforward for my tastes.  I''d like to see it at a little bit of an alternative perspective.  I think the biggest thing is is that it is taken from too close of a proximity.  step back a little and find something that has some interest besides the water.  Good thought, just a little bit plain for me.</td>', 'This is a great subject, but its a little too straightforward for my tastes.  I''d like to see it at a little bit of an alternative perspective.  I think the biggest thing is is that it is taken from too close of a proximity.  step back a little and find something that has some interest besides the water.  Good thought, just a little bit plain for me.', '2004-02-21 01:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(591670, 60430, 3540, '<td valign="top">Can''t be too cold with the pool all the way filled up.  This is novelty as a photo more than anything else.  There is possibilities that you could explore with the sun and the swimming pool and making some strong contrasting shots.</td>', 'Can''t be too cold with the pool all the way filled up.  This is novelty as a photo more than anything else.  There is possibilities that you could explore with the sun and the swimming pool and making some strong contrasting shots.', '2004-02-21 01:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(591671, 60221, 3540, '<td valign="top">The placement of the boat in the frame seems too high up.  I like where it is in regard to left or right placement.</td>', 'The placement of the boat in the frame seems too high up.  I like where it is in regard to left or right placement.', '2004-02-21 01:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(591672, 60699, 3540, '<td valign="top">Need a focal point to this one.  This looks like a reasonable backdrop with no subject.</td>', 'Need a focal point to this one.  This looks like a reasonable backdrop with no subject.', '2004-02-21 01:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(591673, 60376, 3540, '<td valign="top">Hot hot hot.  Maybe the weather, but the picture is overall too exposed.  Needs to be less bright and that would yield better colors and better definition of the textures in the sand.</td>', 'Hot hot hot.  Maybe the weather, but the picture is overall too exposed.  Needs to be less bright and that would yield better colors and better definition of the textures in the sand.', '2004-02-21 01:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(591674, 59568, 3540, '<td valign="top">I would''ve changed the toning to a definite sepia on this one.  You''re most of the way there now.  I''d change the frame a little to by cropping some on the right side and a little of the bottom.</td>', 'I would''ve changed the toning to a definite sepia on this one.  You''re most of the way there now.  I''d change the frame a little to by cropping some on the right side and a little of the bottom.', '2004-02-21 01:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(591678, 59834, 14012, '<td valign="top">great composition</td>', 'great composition', '2004-02-21 02:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(591731, 60584, 10848, '<td valign="top">Amazing 10</td>', 'Amazing 10', '2004-02-21 04:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(591741, 60654, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful poise and grace in the composition, lovely lighting and weather. That black mass at the base of the nearest one is the only imperfection in a supreme shot. I would have cloned it out.</td>', 'Beautiful poise and grace in the composition, lovely lighting and weather. That black mass at the base of the nearest one is the only imperfection in a supreme shot. I would have cloned it out.', '2004-02-21 05:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(591744, 60131, 8860, '<td valign="top">A serene and tranquil shot, well composed. But I would have cloned out the wire mesh which slightly spolis the natural feel of the scene.</td>', 'A serene and tranquil shot, well composed. But I would have cloned out the wire mesh which slightly spolis the natural feel of the scene.', '2004-02-21 05:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(591878, 59876, 10084, '<td valign="top">The smoothnes of the water makes it look like the boat is actually in the clouds and floating in the sky. The soft contrast gives a heavenly appearance. "10"</td>', 'The smoothnes of the water makes it look like the boat is actually in the clouds and floating in the sky. The soft contrast gives a heavenly appearance. "10"', '2004-02-21 06:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(591881, 60521, 10084, '<td valign="top">The composition gives a great sense of yin yang. The water meeting the land. The diagonal cropping really helps to give this feeling. Also the contrast of the blacks on the land and the whiteness of the water foam helps.</td>', 'The composition gives a great sense of yin yang. The water meeting the land. The diagonal cropping really helps to give this feeling. Also the contrast of the blacks on the land and the whiteness of the water foam helps.', '2004-02-21 07:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(591901, 60654, 17072, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot.', '2004-02-21 07:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(591913, 60605, 17072, '<td valign="top">Wow. Beatiful.</td>', 'Wow. Beatiful.', '2004-02-21 07:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(591914, 60062, 17072, '<td valign="top">Nice pic but lacking in originality</td>', 'Nice pic but lacking in originality', '2004-02-21 07:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(591916, 60329, 17072, '<td valign="top">I see earth and fire...</td>', 'I see earth and fire...', '2004-02-21 07:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(591933, 60427, 17072, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast, I think.</td>', 'Too much contrast, I think.', '2004-02-21 07:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(591934, 60045, 17072, '<td valign="top">Well done</td>', 'Well done', '2004-02-21 07:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(591949, 60505, 3540, '<td valign="top">This totally reminds me of the Wizard of Oz.  Great capture of the clouds and talk about a photo with mood.  This one is great.  I would actually prefer to see this zoomed in just a little bigger.  I would chop a little off the right side and nix the border... You can barely see it anyway.  Great job not withstanding. 9</td>', 'This totally reminds me of the Wizard of Oz.  Great capture of the clouds and talk about a photo with mood.  This one is great.  I would actually prefer to see this zoomed in just a little bigger.  I would chop a little off the right side and nix the border... You can barely see it anyway.  Great job not withstanding. 9', '2004-02-21 08:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(591950, 60459, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  I actually have a guess on who''s phtoto this is just by the style.  It wouldn''t surprise me at all to see this in the ribbons.  Good luck 9</td>', 'Very good photo.  I actually have a guess on who''s phtoto this is just by the style.  It wouldn''t surprise me at all to see this in the ribbons.  Good luck 9', '2004-02-21 08:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(591952, 60640, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Just the slightest bit hot though.  I think I might''ve got a little less mountain or hill and a little more sky.  THe hill is not adding much drama to this photo as I think the sky would.</td>', 'Great colors.  Just the slightest bit hot though.  I think I might''ve got a little less mountain or hill and a little more sky.  THe hill is not adding much drama to this photo as I think the sky would.', '2004-02-21 08:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(591953, 60616, 3540, '<td valign="top">Yucky sky day.  I''d hate to say don''t shoot on those days, but its rare when of the pictures comes out.  Especially in color.  You can occastionally salvage a black and white or sepia.</td>', 'Yucky sky day.  I''d hate to say don''t shoot on those days, but its rare when of the pictures comes out.  Especially in color.  You can occastionally salvage a black and white or sepia.', '2004-02-21 08:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(591956, 60272, 3540, '<td valign="top">What a very interesting capture.  Very cool icicles and what an awesome find.  Its not the most compelling picture, but it is quite intriguing.  Good job 7</td>', 'What a very interesting capture.  Very cool icicles and what an awesome find.  Its not the most compelling picture, but it is quite intriguing.  Good job 7', '2004-02-21 08:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(591961, 59876, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''d be surprised (at this point anyway) if this photo isn''t in the ribbons, or at least in the top 10.  This is the most compelling photo I''ve seen for this challenge.  This is remarkably well done.  Awesome work.  If it were my photo, I''d have chopped a little off the left and off the bottom to bring the boat slightly more toward the center and slightly closer.  Good Luck.  I think you''ll do well.  But I''ve been wrong before 9</td>', 'I''d be surprised (at this point anyway) if this photo isn''t in the ribbons, or at least in the top 10.  This is the most compelling photo I''ve seen for this challenge.  This is remarkably well done.  Awesome work.  If it were my photo, I''d have chopped a little off the left and off the bottom to bring the boat slightly more toward the center and slightly closer.  Good Luck.  I think you''ll do well.  But I''ve been wrong before 9', '2004-02-21 08:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(591967, 60234, 3540, '<td valign="top">This needs a subject.  Its a nice backdrop, but no focal point.  Something colorful would be preferred too.  It needs a compelling visually appealing center of attention.</td>', 'This needs a subject.  Its a nice backdrop, but no focal point.  Something colorful would be preferred too.  It needs a compelling visually appealing center of attention.', '2004-02-21 08:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(591977, 60666, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a little bit tight in the frame.  You have the room to move it to make it fit better.  You could also come in even closer and that would also be okay.  This is not as clear as it could be either, which is what I''d like to see for this kind of photo.</td>', 'This is a little bit tight in the frame.  You have the room to move it to make it fit better.  You could also come in even closer and that would also be okay.  This is not as clear as it could be either, which is what I''d like to see for this kind of photo.', '2004-02-21 08:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(591979, 60020, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice blue sky.  The subject needs a little more color to give the overall photo some more impact.  Its just not that appealing.  The focus is a little bit off too.  Good Luck</td>', 'Nice blue sky.  The subject needs a little more color to give the overall photo some more impact.  Its just not that appealing.  The focus is a little bit off too.  Good Luck', '2004-02-21 08:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(591983, 60357, 3540, '<td valign="top">The green water is great.  I''d have lost the border and given us more picture.  This looks like a cool place to get some pictures.  It might be better if you took a few steps back and really awed us with this little bit of rapids in a little more entirety<br/></td>', 'The green water is great.  I''d have lost the border and given us more picture.  This looks like a cool place to get some pictures.  It might be better if you took a few steps back and really awed us with this little bit of rapids in a little more entirety', '2004-02-21 08:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(591990, 60521, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo seems just a little bit soft to me.  It needs a center of attention too.</td>', 'This photo seems just a little bit soft to me.  It needs a center of attention too.', '2004-02-21 08:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(591992, 60489, 3540, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know in England that the rivers ran downhill from R to L.  Good thing to know in case in case I travel there someday.  Nice reflections.  THe ship on the left side throws the whole thing out of balance though.  I''d like to see that ship a little more in the middle to draw all of the attention to it because I think its really cool 7</td>', 'I didn''t know in England that the rivers ran downhill from R to L.  Good thing to know in case in case I travel there someday.  Nice reflections.  THe ship on the left side throws the whole thing out of balance though.  I''d like to see that ship a little more in the middle to draw all of the attention to it because I think its really cool 7', '2004-02-21 08:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(591993, 60590, 3540, '<td valign="top">Not the greatest conditions to take this picture and not really of very good quality.</td>', 'Not the greatest conditions to take this picture and not really of very good quality.', '2004-02-21 08:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(591995, 60267, 3540, '<td valign="top">This has a familar look to it.  It has a color that totally reminds me of Kiwiness'' trick shot with the martini glass.  should be in the top 10, maybe even a ribbon.  Very well done and the first 10 of the challenge for me</td>', 'This has a familar look to it.  It has a color that totally reminds me of Kiwiness'' trick shot with the martini glass.  should be in the top 10, maybe even a ribbon.  Very well done and the first 10 of the challenge for me', '2004-02-21 08:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(592013, 60001, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very good exposure on the fire.  Problem for me is that your image doesn''t hold my interest.  It needs more than just the flame and embers for me.  4</td>', 'Very good exposure on the fire.  Problem for me is that your image doesn''t hold my interest.  It needs more than just the flame and embers for me.  4', '2004-02-21 10:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(592017, 60479, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very nice job of exposure and focus on the texture of this leaf. A tiny bit bright in areas. Overall it doesn''t hold my interest.  5</td>', 'Very nice job of exposure and focus on the texture of this leaf. A tiny bit bright in areas. Overall it doesn''t hold my interest.  5', '2004-02-21 10:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(592020, 60373, 1202, '<td valign="top">I would like to be seeing more of the tractor and its surroundings.   I think it loses impact with the tight crop.   Good eye though.  5</td>', 'I would like to be seeing more of the tractor and its surroundings.   I think it loses impact with the tight crop.   Good eye though.  5', '2004-02-21 10:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(592022, 60638, 1202, '<td valign="top">The uneveness ofyour water drops sets this image aside from all the others.  Different prospective is good for me.  7</td>', 'The uneveness ofyour water drops sets this image aside from all the others.  Different prospective is good for me.  7', '2004-02-21 10:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(592023, 60459, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good job of capturing a very pretty setting.   Fits challenge well.</td>', 'Good job of capturing a very pretty setting.   Fits challenge well.', '2004-02-21 10:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(592024, 60136, 1202, '<td valign="top">My monitor shows it a bit washed out in the center.  If the exposure showed a little more detail it would have much more impact on me. Panoramic shape is nice.</td>', 'My monitor shows it a bit washed out in the center.  If the exposure showed a little more detail it would have much more impact on me. Panoramic shape is nice.', '2004-02-21 10:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(592026, 60640, 1202, '<td valign="top">With only about 30 seconds to get the shot, you have done well.  A little bright at the sun, I would like to see the ones that came a littl later.  I presume it is sunset, earlier if a sunrise. 6</td>', 'With only about 30 seconds to get the shot, you have done well.  A little bright at the sun, I would like to see the ones that came a littl later.  I presume it is sunset, earlier if a sunrise. 6', '2004-02-21 10:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(592029, 60272, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have a super eye and have given this image great composition.  I only wish the right side were a bit darker, its starting to wash out.  7</td>', 'You have a super eye and have given this image great composition.  I only wish the right side were a bit darker, its starting to wash out.  7', '2004-02-21 10:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(592031, 60505, 1202, '<td valign="top">This looks like a scene from "Widard of OZ".  You have captured three of thee lemens and would have had fire if only there were a lightning bolt.  My best pick so far.  9</td>', 'This looks like a scene from "Widard of OZ".  You have captured three of thee lemens and would have had fire if only there were a lightning bolt.  My best pick so far.  9', '2004-02-21 10:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(592034, 60567, 1202, '<td valign="top">Looks mighty cold to me.  Great shot.  When I look at it I want to see more upstream, don''t know if that is good or bad.</td>', 'Looks mighty cold to me.  Great shot.  When I look at it I want to see more upstream, don''t know if that is good or bad.', '2004-02-21 10:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(592036, 60396, 1202, '<td valign="top">I feel that your eposure was a little too long.  The water flow kind of has a snowy appearance, and the movement is all but lost.</td>', 'I feel that your eposure was a little too long.  The water flow kind of has a snowy appearance, and the movement is all but lost.', '2004-02-21 10:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(592039, 60654, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and great color.I like the subject also.  7</td>', 'Nice composition and great color.I like the subject also.  7', '2004-02-21 10:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(592042, 60699, 1202, '<td valign="top">Your diagonal isn''t working for you here.  It leads me into and then right out of the picture.  I think a lower perspective would help keep the viewer in the picture.  5</td>', 'Your diagonal isn''t working for you here.  It leads me into and then right out of the picture.  I think a lower perspective would help keep the viewer in the picture.  5', '2004-02-21 10:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(592044, 60605, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image and an excellent entry. Combining all four elements whilst also producing an image that is so appealing outside of the theme.<br/>I particularly like the lines of the tree shadows and sunshine falling on the earth.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image and an excellent entry. Combining all four elements whilst also producing an image that is so appealing outside of the theme.I particularly like the lines of the tree shadows and sunshine falling on the earth.', '2004-02-21 10:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(592047, 59994, 3087, '<td valign="top">The tracks certainly give a focal point and strengthen composition, alongside the parallel triangle of rock to the lower right of the frame.</td>', 'The tracks certainly give a focal point and strengthen composition, alongside the parallel triangle of rock to the lower right of the frame.', '2004-02-21 10:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(592063, 60616, 1202, '<td valign="top">I hope I am not too harsh, but your image makes me think you need to spend some time with composition.   For what it is worth a picture is generally read from left to right and from front to back.  Your main subject should take you into the frame and you have to be careful not to allow something to take your eye out of the frame.  As I try to get into it the darker upright limb takes me right out.  I think if you could have isolated some of the wonderful ferns and taken them from a prspective that the trunk they are on could take you into the frame you would end up with a much more powerful image.  4</td>', 'I hope I am not too harsh, but your image makes me think you need to spend some time with composition.   For what it is worth a picture is generally read from left to right and from front to back.  Your main subject should take you into the frame and you have to be careful not to allow something to take your eye out of the frame.  As I try to get into it the darker upright limb takes me right out.  I think if you could have isolated some of the wonderful ferns and taken them from a prspective that the trunk they are on could take you into the frame you would end up with a much more powerful image.  4', '2004-02-21 10:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(592072, 60654, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice use of perspective to show both the scale of an individual wind turbine as well as the expanse of empty land that this wind farm is situated in. I like the way you''ve picked a time of day that adds interest to the shot by providing graduated colour and beautiful glints on the sides of the turbines.</td>', 'Nice use of perspective to show both the scale of an individual wind turbine as well as the expanse of empty land that this wind farm is situated in. I like the way you''ve picked a time of day that adds interest to the shot by providing graduated colour and beautiful glints on the sides of the turbines.', '2004-02-21 10:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(592073, 60329, 1202, '<td valign="top">I feel you are trying to make the shot with the title.   Sometimes every body does it but with little success.   The spike holes jump out to me along with the butt and become the main subject.   MIght I suggest "Rained Out" for a title.  I now see disgust,wet environment and no game.   5</td>', 'I feel you are trying to make the shot with the title.   Sometimes every body does it but with little success.   The spike holes jump out to me along with the butt and become the main subject.   MIght I suggest "Rained Out" for a title.  I now see disgust,wet environment and no game.   5', '2004-02-21 10:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(592074, 59876, 3087, '<td valign="top">Your title certainly matches what the image conveys - floating peacefully on the tranquil waters... Good choice to go for black and white to really highlight the cloudy shadows in the still water.</td>', 'Your title certainly matches what the image conveys - floating peacefully on the tranquil waters... Good choice to go for black and white to really highlight the cloudy shadows in the still water.', '2004-02-21 10:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(592075, 60126, 1202, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure on your stream.  The flame is in such an inappripriate area that it spoils an otherwise great shot for me.  6</td>', 'Perfect exposure on your stream.  The flame is in such an inappripriate area that it spoils an otherwise great shot for me.  6', '2004-02-21 10:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(592083, 60143, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract feel and conveys so much more than just the concept of wind - it takes me back to summer days on the beach running around with similar whirly wind powered toys and I can even feel the sun and wind on my skin. I like the angle of the spindle, the amount of motion blur compared to the amount of discernable detail and I like the way the blue sky is broken up the fluffy white cloud.</td>', 'Wonderful abstract feel and conveys so much more than just the concept of wind - it takes me back to summer days on the beach running around with similar whirly wind powered toys and I can even feel the sun and wind on my skin. I like the angle of the spindle, the amount of motion blur compared to the amount of discernable detail and I like the way the blue sky is broken up the fluffy white cloud.', '2004-02-21 11:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(592087, 60637, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice composition infront of good black backdrop. I''d say that the image would have more impact of there were less distracting detail in the model - a shave would mean that the light wouldn''t catch those wee white hairs along the chin and neck which keep attracting my focus.</td>', 'Great idea and nice composition infront of good black backdrop. I''d say that the image would have more impact of there were less distracting detail in the model - a shave would mean that the light wouldn''t catch those wee white hairs along the chin and neck which keep attracting my focus.', '2004-02-21 11:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(592092, 60272, 3087, '<td valign="top">What in interesting icicle formation - it makes for a striking image with a composition focused on lines - four "rows" across (water, black shadow from the underhand, icicles and solid ice) plus vertical columns from the icicles themselves. My only preference would be for more even lighting left to right.</td>', 'What in interesting icicle formation - it makes for a striking image with a composition focused on lines - four "rows" across (water, black shadow from the underhand, icicles and solid ice) plus vertical columns from the icicles themselves. My only preference would be for more even lighting left to right.', '2004-02-21 11:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(592094, 60266, 3087, '<td valign="top">Feels a little tilted off the horizontal but I like the low viewpoint and straightforward capture. The detail in the hob ring is great - like a circle of smiles.</td>', 'Feels a little tilted off the horizontal but I like the low viewpoint and straightforward capture. The detail in the hob ring is great - like a circle of smiles.', '2004-02-21 11:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(592097, 60658, 6130, '<td valign="top">So beautiful.</td>', 'So beautiful.', '2004-02-21 11:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(592100, 60505, 3087, '<td valign="top">A dramatic and striking landscape with a very brooding atmosphere conveyed by the clouds and light.</td>', 'A dramatic and striking landscape with a very brooding atmosphere conveyed by the clouds and light.', '2004-02-21 11:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(592101, 60680, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very good and I get thirsty.</td>', 'Very good and I get thirsty.', '2004-02-21 11:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(592102, 60371, 5007, '<td valign="top">I love the patterns in the ripples and the bright colors. It makes me keep looking at it.</td>', 'I love the patterns in the ripples and the bright colors. It makes me keep looking at it.', '2004-02-21 11:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(592103, 60234, 6130, '<td valign="top">Simple and very good.</td>', 'Simple and very good.', '2004-02-21 11:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(592104, 59568, 3087, '<td valign="top">A serene scene but a little overcast to appeal strongly to me. I also find the composition a little too centred and would be interested to see alternative shots of the same subject with different balances between water and sky, as well as different positions of the island within the frame.</td>', 'A serene scene but a little overcast to appeal strongly to me. I also find the composition a little too centred and would be interested to see alternative shots of the same subject with different balances between water and sky, as well as different positions of the island within the frame.', '2004-02-21 11:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(592105, 59985, 5007, '<td valign="top">Very nice, visually pleasing.</td>', 'Very nice, visually pleasing.', '2004-02-21 11:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(592106, 60641, 6130, '<td valign="top">Simple and good.</td>', 'Simple and good.', '2004-02-21 11:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(592107, 59884, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-02-21 11:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(592108, 59834, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-02-21 11:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(592109, 60368, 3087, '<td valign="top">Going further than the usual long exposure to really blur the water motion makes this more abstract and hence more appealing. Though many parts of the frame are pure white I think this lack of detail and solidity balances the dark, detailed surface of the rocks.</td>', 'Going further than the usual long exposure to really blur the water motion makes this more abstract and hence more appealing. Though many parts of the frame are pure white I think this lack of detail and solidity balances the dark, detailed surface of the rocks.', '2004-02-21 11:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(592110, 60625, 6130, '<td valign="top">Fantasic.</td>', 'Fantasic.', '2004-02-21 11:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(592111, 60505, 6130, '<td valign="top">Dramatic and good.</td>', 'Dramatic and good.', '2004-02-21 11:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(592129, 59787, 6130, '<td valign="top">Clever and good.</td>', 'Clever and good.', '2004-02-21 12:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(592131, 59736, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-02-21 12:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(592132, 60266, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-02-21 12:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(592137, 59876, 1202, '<td valign="top">I can find no fault here, wonderfully done!</td>', 'I can find no fault here, wonderfully done!', '2004-02-21 12:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(592139, 59567, 1202, '<td valign="top">Camera shake and inadequate focus do not enhance this image.  The obtrusive (telephone?) in the BG really is distracting.  In my opinion you need to take more time and study just what you are getting in your photo.</td>', 'Camera shake and inadequate focus do not enhance this image.  The obtrusive (telephone?) in the BG really is distracting.  In my opinion you need to take more time and study just what you are getting in your photo.', '2004-02-21 12:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
