(592142, 60490, 1202, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!  One lampost too many, but perfect otherwise.  8 I just changed it to a 9</td>', 'Wonderful shot!  One lampost too many, but perfect otherwise.  8 I just changed it to a 9', '2004-02-21 12:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(592155, 60487, 17604, '<td valign="top">Oh my god. I love the immaculate reflections, and the starkness of the picture.</td>', 'Oh my god. I love the immaculate reflections, and the starkness of the picture.', '2004-02-21 13:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(592161, 60587, 9546, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo</td>', 'Awesome photo', '2004-02-21 13:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(592246, 60373, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good rich colour here and a good angle.</td>', 'Good rich colour here and a good angle.', '2004-02-21 15:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(592247, 60487, 7889, '<td valign="top">I like this type of shot, i love reflection in water and you have done it well here.</td>', 'I like this type of shot, i love reflection in water and you have done it well here.', '2004-02-21 15:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(592248, 60194, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good capture, but the squemish folk on here will not thank you!</td>', 'Good capture, but the squemish folk on here will not thank you!', '2004-02-21 15:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(592267, 60107, 11248, '<td valign="top">Best fire picture on this challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'Best fire picture on this challenge. Good luck.', '2004-02-21 16:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(592322, 60368, 15330, '<td valign="top">This photo stands out from the rest of the flowing river photos because of the sense of movement. You must have used a very long shutter speed to get this effect, and it works great. I also like the composition, the rocks aren''t in the center, but are offset which in my opinion is good.</td>', 'This photo stands out from the rest of the flowing river photos because of the sense of movement. You must have used a very long shutter speed to get this effect, and it works great. I also like the composition, the rocks aren''t in the center, but are offset which in my opinion is good.', '2004-02-21 17:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(592324, 60652, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like how the flower stands out from everythig else because of its bright color compared to the dark, and dull bakcground. This is a great idea of showing the element earth, good job.</td>', 'I like how the flower stands out from everythig else because of its bright color compared to the dark, and dull bakcground. This is a great idea of showing the element earth, good job.', '2004-02-21 17:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(592328, 60455, 15330, '<td valign="top">There are too many dark spots in the photo, the scene is also too busy with so many branches on the top of the photo. You should have tried a different perspective and captured just one waterfall in the photo, this would make it simpler and less distracting.</td>', 'There are too many dark spots in the photo, the scene is also too busy with so many branches on the top of the photo. You should have tried a different perspective and captured just one waterfall in the photo, this would make it simpler and less distracting.', '2004-02-21 17:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(592333, 60654, 15330, '<td valign="top">Good idea in showing wind, and the element air. To improve this you should have tried to capture some movement in the blades if they were spinning. The sky adds a lot to the photo, if it was just a plain blue sky this wouldn''t have been as good.</td>', 'Good idea in showing wind, and the element air. To improve this you should have tried to capture some movement in the blades if they were spinning. The sky adds a lot to the photo, if it was just a plain blue sky this wouldn''t have been as good.', '2004-02-21 17:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(592335, 60136, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like that you used black and white for this. The sky is great, being dark at the very top, and scattering as it gets closer to the horizon. You should have done something to get rid of that bright sunlight in the center of the frame.</td>', 'I like that you used black and white for this. The sky is great, being dark at the very top, and scattering as it gets closer to the horizon. You should have done something to get rid of that bright sunlight in the center of the frame.', '2004-02-21 17:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(592337, 60485, 15330, '<td valign="top">This photo is great, the lighting is very good. Looking at the title I autamatically thought earth which is probobly what you intnded. The leaf is offset from the middle which is very good for composition. Great job.</td>', 'This photo is great, the lighting is very good. Looking at the title I autamatically thought earth which is probobly what you intnded. The leaf is offset from the middle which is very good for composition. Great job.', '2004-02-21 17:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
