(592415, 60290, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, decent composition (forground a bit busy).  Nice job - Good luck.</td>', 'Nice tones, decent composition (forground a bit busy).  Nice job - Good luck.', '2004-02-21 18:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(592417, 60251, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good water effects.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice composition and good water effects.  Good luck.', '2004-02-21 18:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(592418, 60491, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure and focus.  Composition is ok.  Nice color.   Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice exposure and focus.  Composition is ok.  Nice color.   Good luck!', '2004-02-21 18:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(592420, 60490, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very neat picture, building has a painted look, good job!</td>', 'Very neat picture, building has a painted look, good job!', '2004-02-21 18:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(592424, 60156, 6600, '<td valign="top">Neat look,for an inner city.  Contrasting light distracts a bit.  Good luck!</td>', 'Neat look,for an inner city.  Contrasting light distracts a bit.  Good luck!', '2004-02-21 18:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(592426, 60001, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed (for a fire), can be tricky.  Good job!</td>', 'Nicely exposed (for a fire), can be tricky.  Good job!', '2004-02-21 18:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(592437, 59776, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect with the water, nice composition.  Well done, good luck.</td>', 'Very nice effect with the water, nice composition.  Well done, good luck.', '2004-02-21 19:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(592439, 60368, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice water effect, good composition.  Nice job, good luck.</td>', 'Nice water effect, good composition.  Nice job, good luck.', '2004-02-21 19:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(592447, 60505, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2004-02-21 19:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(592451, 60589, 13610, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit overexposed but very good</td>', 'Maybe a bit overexposed but very good', '2004-02-21 19:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(592452, 60644, 13610, '<td valign="top">The flower seem to be the subject instead of the water.</td>', 'The flower seem to be the subject instead of the water.', '2004-02-21 19:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(592475, 59722, 8860, '<td valign="top">Serenely beautiful and surely a ribbon entry. The moisture in the air is tangible and it looks like a beautiful scene to behold. Flawless composition. Lovely. White border is just a little too heavy - 1 pixel is just fine!</td>', 'Serenely beautiful and surely a ribbon entry. The moisture in the air is tangible and it looks like a beautiful scene to behold. Flawless composition. Lovely. White border is just a little too heavy - 1 pixel is just fine!', '2004-02-21 19:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(592477, 60272, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very cute entry and nicely observed. The DOF is a touch too narrow so I would have gone for a larger aperture to retain all focus. Since there is no movement captured this would be fine provided you have a steady camera.</td>', 'Very cute entry and nicely observed. The DOF is a touch too narrow so I would have gone for a larger aperture to retain all focus. Since there is no movement captured this would be fine provided you have a steady camera.', '2004-02-21 19:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(592479, 59776, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture - shot is a bit gloomy. Nice touches of colour.</td>', 'Beautiful capture - shot is a bit gloomy. Nice touches of colour.', '2004-02-21 19:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(592482, 60126, 8860, '<td valign="top">A lovely scene although, despite adding an extra element with fire, I feel that this is a bit trite and unnecessary, making me conscious that this is a challenge photo rather than simply beauty in its own right. Goo details and  nice water flow.<br/> <br/>I would have cropped out the roots at the top left of the frame.</td>', 'A lovely scene although, despite adding an extra element with fire, I feel that this is a bit trite and unnecessary, making me conscious that this is a challenge photo rather than simply beauty in its own right. Goo details and  nice water flow. I would have cropped out the roots at the top left of the frame.', '2004-02-21 19:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(592483, 60676, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely vibe and nice textures, although it seems a bit overtly treated to me. I particularly like the muted colours.</td>', 'Lovely vibe and nice textures, although it seems a bit overtly treated to me. I particularly like the muted colours.', '2004-02-21 20:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(592486, 60156, 6458, '<td valign="top">Really nice water smoothness. I love the composition, but I''m not quite as sold on the lighting. Overexposed top takes the attention away from the lovely water.</td>', 'Really nice water smoothness. I love the composition, but I''m not quite as sold on the lighting. Overexposed top takes the attention away from the lovely water.', '2004-02-21 20:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(592488, 60480, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very satisfying shot. Nice lighting and very aesthetic.</td>', 'Very satisfying shot. Nice lighting and very aesthetic.', '2004-02-21 20:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(592491, 59985, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, good composition, but misleading title (for me anyway). Great sky and very well focused.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, good composition, but misleading title (for me anyway). Great sky and very well focused.', '2004-02-21 20:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(592493, 60522, 8860, '<td valign="top">Memorable shot with a lomographic quality. I''m not totally convinced by what you''re trying to achieve, but an interesting photo is an interesting photo! It''s well taken too.</td>', 'Memorable shot with a lomographic quality. I''m not totally convinced by what you''re trying to achieve, but an interesting photo is an interesting photo! It''s well taken too.', '2004-02-21 20:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(592498, 60369, 8860, '<td valign="top">Hey that''s cheating! Not everyone has the world''s tallest tree in their back garden.  ;)<br/> <br/>Nice capture but I think a wider aperture would have helped keep the branches in focus - the shallow DOF is a bit frustrating.</td>', 'Hey that''s cheating! Not everyone has the world''s tallest tree in their back garden.  ;) Nice capture but I think a wider aperture would have helped keep the branches in focus - the shallow DOF is a bit frustrating.', '2004-02-21 20:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(592499, 60156, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very unusual picture. I think some careful dodging ion the shaded areas would lift this a bit, but I think this is a marketable shot of a very interesting subject. White areas on the buildings a bit hot too.</td>', 'Very unusual picture. I think some careful dodging ion the shaded areas would lift this a bit, but I think this is a marketable shot of a very interesting subject. White areas on the buildings a bit hot too.', '2004-02-21 20:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(592502, 60382, 12160, '<td valign="top">Neat idea to see a rose on fire. Good image, fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Neat idea to see a rose on fire. Good image, fits the challenge well.', '2004-02-21 20:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(592503, 59846, 8860, '<td valign="top">This looks way to synthetic for my taste. Looks like a strange technique too, but it''s been disguised with the muddy toning.</td>', 'This looks way to synthetic for my taste. Looks like a strange technique too, but it''s been disguised with the muddy toning.', '2004-02-21 20:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(592506, 60590, 8860, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, blah, blah, blah!<br/> <br/>Sorry, but it is and it wouldn''t take much effort to resolve. Not a bad composition otherwise and you had some nice lighting.</td>', 'Out of focus, blah, blah, blah! Sorry, but it is and it wouldn''t take much effort to resolve. Not a bad composition otherwise and you had some nice lighting.', '2004-02-21 20:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(592509, 60221, 8860, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t grab me I''m afraid. It''s a bit busy and with too little ''reward'' after establishing what the subject is. I think if this shot were able to include a lot more lateral context then the boat would look even more stranded and isolated.</td>', 'This doesn''t grab me I''m afraid. It''s a bit busy and with too little ''reward'' after establishing what the subject is. I think if this shot were able to include a lot more lateral context then the boat would look even more stranded and isolated.', '2004-02-21 20:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(592512, 60487, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp - good comp.</td>', 'Nice and crisp - good comp.', '2004-02-21 20:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(592519, 60680, 8860, '<td valign="top">The idea''s there but this is not attractive and lacks the perfection required to pull off a shot like this. As a viewer I feel uninvolved in the action and the colours are a bit harsh.</td>', 'The idea''s there but this is not attractive and lacks the perfection required to pull off a shot like this. As a viewer I feel uninvolved in the action and the colours are a bit harsh.', '2004-02-21 20:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(592522, 60505, 8860, '<td valign="top">Quite dramatic stuff with some nice touches. You''ve pushed the contrast quite hard though and the noise is more apparent. I would probably have cloned out every other detail in ths frame apart from just the tree.</td>', 'Quite dramatic stuff with some nice touches. You''ve pushed the contrast quite hard though and the noise is more apparent. I would probably have cloned out every other detail in ths frame apart from just the tree.', '2004-02-21 20:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(592523, 60179, 12160, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea, fits the challenge well. The composition is good, the focus on the subject is clear, exposure is not bad.  I see a blue tint all over the photo which is probably caused by incorrect white balance setting. If your camera is capable of a shallow dof, using wider aperture will help blur the background to put more emphasis on the subject.</td>', 'It''s a nice idea, fits the challenge well. The composition is good, the focus on the subject is clear, exposure is not bad.  I see a blue tint all over the photo which is probably caused by incorrect white balance setting. If your camera is capable of a shallow dof, using wider aperture will help blur the background to put more emphasis on the subject.', '2004-02-21 20:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(592527, 59787, 12160, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice still life photo. Neat idea. Exposure is good and the lighting is done well, I don''t see glares from your light source (from above?) on the glasses which is a pain when photographing shiny objects.</td>', 'It''s a nice still life photo. Neat idea. Exposure is good and the lighting is done well, I don''t see glares from your light source (from above?) on the glasses which is a pain when photographing shiny objects.', '2004-02-21 20:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(592530, 60146, 12160, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, love the mist the fogs the background in the distance. well done. 8</td>', 'Beautiful, love the mist the fogs the background in the distance. well done. 8', '2004-02-21 20:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(592533, 60485, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very simple yet very powerful. 9</td>', 'Very simple yet very powerful. 9', '2004-02-21 20:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(592539, 60427, 12160, '<td valign="top">It seems there''s an exposure issue here. The shadows are too dark and the highlights are nearly blown out. In my mind this is probably intentional. I quite like it although I would have rendered it in b/w.</td>', 'It seems there''s an exposure issue here. The shadows are too dark and the highlights are nearly blown out. In my mind this is probably intentional. I quite like it although I would have rendered it in b/w.', '2004-02-21 20:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(592548, 60589, 12160, '<td valign="top">love the atmosphere of this photo, the shallow dof and the soft focus add character to it. I find the chair on the left a little bit of a distraction. Nice photo nonetheless. 8</td>', 'love the atmosphere of this photo, the shallow dof and the soft focus add character to it. I find the chair on the left a little bit of a distraction. Nice photo nonetheless. 8', '2004-02-21 20:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(592553, 59787, 17587, '<td valign="top">I would vote for this photo because you are the only one who truly captured all 4 elements. simple and creative.</td>', 'I would vote for this photo because you are the only one who truly captured all 4 elements. simple and creative.', '2004-02-21 20:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(592564, 59921, 6597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors 8</td>', 'Beautiful colors 8', '2004-02-21 21:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(592583, 60001, 16040, '<td valign="top">I have tried to shoot fire<br/>not much luck<br/>nice job</td>', 'I have tried to shoot firenot much lucknice job', '2004-02-21 22:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(592586, 59921, 16040, '<td valign="top">photoshop magic I hope<br/>creative</td>', 'photoshop magic I hopecreative', '2004-02-21 22:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(592609, 60587, 12160, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo of a beautiful scenery. 10</td>', 'beautiful photo of a beautiful scenery. 10', '2004-02-21 23:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(592624, 60427, 15574, '<td valign="top">ouch thats bright</td>', 'ouch thats bright', '2004-02-21 23:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(592670, 60637, 15011, '<td valign="top">so u had my chili</td>', 'so u had my chili', '2004-02-22 00:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(592706, 60652, 17625, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!  I love the contrast and the dirt under her nails.  Excellent!</td>', 'Fantastic shot!  I love the contrast and the dirt under her nails.  Excellent!', '2004-02-22 02:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(592743, 59989, 9906, '<td valign="top">I can not tell what exactly I''m looking at and the title only confuses me more.  Maybe if there was more in the image...<br/>TC</td>', 'I can not tell what exactly I''m looking at and the title only confuses me more.  Maybe if there was more in the image...TC', '2004-02-22 03:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(592746, 60489, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but your horizon is crooked.  Not enough to look intentional.  This is an easy fix in PS.  Let me know if you need help with this issue!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice shot, but your horizon is crooked.  Not enough to look intentional.  This is an easy fix in PS.  Let me know if you need help with this issue!TC', '2004-02-22 03:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(592749, 60290, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  However for this challenge, the thing that pops out at me is the building and I don''t see how that fits the challenge.  Please don''t get me wrong.  I like the shot, but others will dis you on the theme...<br/>TC<br/>PS I would like to see your treatment of this.  It looks like a tri-tone, but I haven''t a trained enough eye to tell for sure...<br/></td>', 'This is beautiful.  However for this challenge, the thing that pops out at me is the building and I don''t see how that fits the challenge.  Please don''t get me wrong.  I like the shot, but others will dis you on the theme...TCPS I would like to see your treatment of this.  It looks like a tri-tone, but I haven''t a trained enough eye to tell for sure...', '2004-02-22 03:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(592751, 60376, 9906, '<td valign="top">Everything here looks fine without the model though you may be a touch over exposed.  Your model, however, looks a little yellow...<br/>TC</td>', 'Everything here looks fine without the model though you may be a touch over exposed.  Your model, however, looks a little yellow...TC', '2004-02-22 03:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(593030, 59876, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m speechless. Can''t wait to make it a favorite, and to see how it was done.  A breathtaking piece of work.  I love the composition.  10</td>', 'I''m speechless. Can''t wait to make it a favorite, and to see how it was done.  A breathtaking piece of work.  I love the composition.  10', '2004-02-22 07:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(593040, 60143, 8860, '<td valign="top">This would make a good stock photo - very effective. Up against the moody shots this may not fair so well, but you should be pleased with the shot anyway - it''s uplifting, proficient and very well taken. My only crit is the movement in the clouds. I think these should be static or a pure blue sky.</td>', 'This would make a good stock photo - very effective. Up against the moody shots this may not fair so well, but you should be pleased with the shot anyway - it''s uplifting, proficient and very well taken. My only crit is the movement in the clouds. I think these should be static or a pure blue sky.', '2004-02-22 08:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(593042, 60271, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like your pov here and the sky makes a nice contrast.  The foreground lacks detail (light) and I think it would make the shot more interesting if I could see it better</td>', 'I like your pov here and the sky makes a nice contrast.  The foreground lacks detail (light) and I think it would make the shot more interesting if I could see it better', '2004-02-22 08:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(593043, 60607, 14614, '<td valign="top">Creative idea here that didn''t quite make it for me.  Perhaps some wood ready for a fire may have given the shot a bit more life.  THe upper left shiney thing distracts my eye.</td>', 'Creative idea here that didn''t quite make it for me.  Perhaps some wood ready for a fire may have given the shot a bit more life.  THe upper left shiney thing distracts my eye.', '2004-02-22 08:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(593045, 60640, 14614, '<td valign="top">I''d like a bit more detail in the the foreground OR more color in the top == as is it''s has too much black area and loses impact.</td>', 'I''d like a bit more detail in the the foreground OR more color in the top == as is it''s has too much black area and loses impact.', '2004-02-22 08:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(593046, 60658, 14614, '<td valign="top">Fine shot, well composed - the repetitive poles add the interest needed.  To make this better, imho, I''d like more light in the forgroung (or overall?) to bring out some of the detail (as is I really can''t tell this is ice)</td>', 'Fine shot, well composed - the repetitive poles add the interest needed.  To make this better, imho, I''d like more light in the forgroung (or overall?) to bring out some of the detail (as is I really can''t tell this is ice)', '2004-02-22 08:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(593047, 60644, 14614, '<td valign="top">You''ve got two somewhat competing aspects of this shot and my attention isn''t flowing from one to the other but rather am left with the feeling these are two different shots/perspectives put in one image.  I do like them both separately!  Toning down the red or bringing more color into the palm trees might be worth playing around with.</td>', 'You''ve got two somewhat competing aspects of this shot and my attention isn''t flowing from one to the other but rather am left with the feeling these are two different shots/perspectives put in one image.  I do like them both separately!  Toning down the red or bringing more color into the palm trees might be worth playing around with.', '2004-02-22 08:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(593048, 60143, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great capture of wind! I really like the blur/sharp subject and you''ve selected an excellent part of the sky to put as the backdrop.  Good job</td>', 'Great capture of wind! I really like the blur/sharp subject and you''ve selected an excellent part of the sky to put as the backdrop.  Good job', '2004-02-22 08:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(593049, 60556, 14614, '<td valign="top">strong composition on the diagonal, pleasing color palette.  Upper right is curious - too small to pull my eye through the shot but too large to ignore.  I like that there''s something there - perhaps more of it?</td>', 'strong composition on the diagonal, pleasing color palette.  Upper right is curious - too small to pull my eye through the shot but too large to ignore.  I like that there''s something there - perhaps more of it?', '2004-02-22 08:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(593052, 60652, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice use of dof = really pops out agains the b&amp;w treatment of hand and dirt.  To make this an even better shot-- the dirt in the fingernails distracts my eye for some reason (others will like it) maybe it''s their length that doesn''t go with digging?  I''d like to see more of the hand - cutting it off mid-palm distrupts the flow. Overall well done.</td>', 'nice use of dof = really pops out agains the b&w treatment of hand and dirt.  To make this an even better shot-- the dirt in the fingernails distracts my eye for some reason (others will like it) maybe it''s their length that doesn''t go with digging?  I''d like to see more of the hand - cutting it off mid-palm distrupts the flow. Overall well done.', '2004-02-22 08:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(593054, 60267, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice abstract quality; good placement in the frame - to make this a higher scorer (imho) I''d like to see a bit more action - the drop or splash droplets - especially given the title.</td>', 'nice abstract quality; good placement in the frame - to make this a higher scorer (imho) I''d like to see a bit more action - the drop or splash droplets - especially given the title.', '2004-02-22 08:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(593056, 60699, 14614, '<td valign="top">strong diagonal and repetition make this a good composition - to make it even better I''d like to see a subject to add scale and perhaps a focal element (even color as the brown.green doens'' grab me)</td>', 'strong diagonal and repetition make this a good composition - to make it even better I''d like to see a subject to add scale and perhaps a focal element (even color as the brown.green doens'' grab me)', '2004-02-22 08:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(593058, 59909, 14614, '<td valign="top">a lot to like here - rocks add a smooth, natural contrast to the "foreign" ball. solid composition and framing.  to impove this solid entry, I''d suggest changing the water in some way to add more life into the composition (bit stagnent) e.g. bubbles or ripples in the water, flowing water.</td>', 'a lot to like here - rocks add a smooth, natural contrast to the "foreign" ball. solid composition and framing.  to impove this solid entry, I''d suggest changing the water in some way to add more life into the composition (bit stagnent) e.g. bubbles or ripples in the water, flowing water.', '2004-02-22 08:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(593066, 59976, 14614, '<td valign="top">so clever and original.  composition of elements works.  to make this a bit better I''d suggest cropping out/cloning out the wire or hanging the pepper on something more photogenic (e.g. longer stem, held by a hand) .  as is well done</td>', 'so clever and original.  composition of elements works.  to make this a bit better I''d suggest cropping out/cloning out the wire or hanging the pepper on something more photogenic (e.g. longer stem, held by a hand) .  as is well done', '2004-02-22 08:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(593081, 59936, 17072, '<td valign="top">OKay,  I gotta know how you did that.</td>', 'OKay,  I gotta know how you did that.', '2004-02-22 09:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(593083, 60571, 17072, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2004-02-22 09:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(593084, 59994, 17072, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the focus is supposed to be? Is it the element of Earth or the snowmobile tracks?</td>', 'I''m not sure what the focus is supposed to be? Is it the element of Earth or the snowmobile tracks?', '2004-02-22 09:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(593086, 59921, 17072, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2004-02-22 09:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(593090, 60384, 11897, '<td valign="top">The idea is good but in my opinion the picture lacks a focal point.<br/>I would certainly reshoot this, it has potential to be a very good shot.</td>', 'The idea is good but in my opinion the picture lacks a focal point.I would certainly reshoot this, it has potential to be a very good shot.', '2004-02-22 09:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(593092, 60530, 11897, '<td valign="top">doesn''t quite make it, no areas of sharpness at all which I think it needs.</td>', 'doesn''t quite make it, no areas of sharpness at all which I think it needs.', '2004-02-22 09:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(593093, 59975, 11897, '<td valign="top">A little cluttered for me, maybe concentrating on one of the rocks would have improved it some, the lighting is a little too harsh on the rocks.</td>', 'A little cluttered for me, maybe concentrating on one of the rocks would have improved it some, the lighting is a little too harsh on the rocks.', '2004-02-22 09:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(593099, 60490, 17072, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot</td>', 'Beautiful shot', '2004-02-22 09:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(593107, 60652, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea, and great use of DOF to isolate the flower. Great shot!</td>', 'Very cool idea, and great use of DOF to isolate the flower. Great shot!', '2004-02-22 09:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(593112, 60635, 17072, '<td valign="top">Nice representation of air</td>', 'Nice representation of air', '2004-02-22 09:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(593113, 60376, 17072, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot but it seems a bit too light.</td>', 'This is a nice shot but it seems a bit too light.', '2004-02-22 09:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(593114, 60026, 17072, '<td valign="top">Pretty.</td>', 'Pretty.', '2004-02-22 09:56:30.000000', NULL, 1);
