(593400, 60666, 14012, '<td valign="top">A rather uninteresting subject. Some things I would have done differently that may have made it more appealing: <br/> <br/>Instead of shooting down on top of the pine cone come at it more straight on (slight angle) from one end. Also, being in color, the yellow background is really bright and takes away from your subject. Because of the very shallow DOF, it is hard to tell where your actual point of focus is.</td>', 'A rather uninteresting subject. Some things I would have done differently that may have made it more appealing:  Instead of shooting down on top of the pine cone come at it more straight on (slight angle) from one end. Also, being in color, the yellow background is really bright and takes away from your subject. Because of the very shallow DOF, it is hard to tell where your actual point of focus is.', '2004-02-22 17:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(593401, 60509, 14012, '<td valign="top">decent macro. The background, lens flare from the flame, and thick purple border detract.</td>', 'decent macro. The background, lens flare from the flame, and thick purple border detract.', '2004-02-22 17:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
