(593593, 60490, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting on the church.  My first impression was ''painting with light'' style, but it seems to far away for that...  Can''t wait to see how ya did it!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very interesting lighting on the church.  My first impression was ''painting with light'' style, but it seems to far away for that...  Can''t wait to see how ya did it!TC', '2004-02-22 22:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
