(593777, 59876, 6349, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Awesome shot.  It was so perfect I suspected that it was a little model of a boat on a mirror.  Our camera did very well this week!  Congrats.</td>', 'Hey!  Awesome shot.  It was so perfect I suspected that it was a little model of a boat on a mirror.  Our camera did very well this week!  Congrats.', '2004-02-23 00:33:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(593786, 60491, 6349, '<td valign="top">Again David...come on, give everyone else a chance!  :)<br/>This is a great image.  I''d be curious to see the original grainy image because I wasn''t a big fan of some of the blurring on this.  It looked a little too unnatural to me and I find myself becoming a fan of grain lately.  Also, what''s going on with the hints of green and red in the snow?  Did you do that in post-processing.  Well, I sound picky now...<br/>I gave this a 10 and still would it''s just interesting to see the choices people make in editing based on the original.<br/>PS.  Wish I lived where you live!</td>', 'Again David...come on, give everyone else a chance!  :)This is a great image.  I''d be curious to see the original grainy image because I wasn''t a big fan of some of the blurring on this.  It looked a little too unnatural to me and I find myself becoming a fan of grain lately.  Also, what''s going on with the hints of green and red in the snow?  Did you do that in post-processing.  Well, I sound picky now...I gave this a 10 and still would it''s just interesting to see the choices people make in editing based on the original.PS.  Wish I lived where you live!', '2004-02-23 00:38:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(593787, 60505, 6349, '<td valign="top">I suspected heavy burning.  Used to good effect.  Would that count for the fire challenge?  (haha stupid joke).  Outstanding photo.  Congrats.</td>', 'I suspected heavy burning.  Used to good effect.  Would that count for the fire challenge?  (haha stupid joke).  Outstanding photo.  Congrats.', '2004-02-23 00:40:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(593790, 59876, 11897, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a marvelous shot</td>', 'Congratulations on a marvelous shot', '2004-02-23 00:52:42.000000', NULL, 0),
