(597219, 59862, 8891, '<td valign="top">THis was one my only ten in the the challenge so I am real surprised that it did not do better. I found this image extremely fascinating and hope you might think of trying it again for the fire challenge, unless, of course you have some other great idea for same.  Like this very much as an abstract and would like to see what you might get with further experimentation.  Great job!   RoB<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-02-25 01:51:25.</i></td>', 'THis was one my only ten in the the challenge so I am real surprised that it did not do better. I found this image extremely fascinating and hope you might think of trying it again for the fire challenge, unless, of course you have some other great idea for same.  Like this very much as an abstract and would like to see what you might get with further experimentation.  Great job!   RoB', '2004-02-25 01:50:34.000000', '2004-02-25 01:51:25.000000', 0),
