(603866, 60010, 14012, '<td valign="top">**Critique Club**<br/> <br/>Hi Ken!<br/> <br/><b>Positives:</b> <br/>Meets the challenge well. I like the line of the shore running up right to left. The natural lighting is good.<br/> <br/><b>Possible Improvements:</b> <br/>There is no real contrasting colors here, so the photo looks rather dull. Maybe bumping up the levels and saturation just a tad would help. Seems to have a bit of noise and might be over-sharpened just a bit, as well.<br/> <br/>Hope you find this critique helpful. Look forward to seeing your future entries.<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Chris</td>', '**Critique Club** Hi Ken! Positives: Meets the challenge well. I like the line of the shore running up right to left. The natural lighting is good. Possible Improvements: There is no real contrasting colors here, so the photo looks rather dull. Maybe bumping up the levels and saturation just a tad would help. Seems to have a bit of noise and might be over-sharpened just a bit, as well. Hope you find this critique helpful. Look forward to seeing your future entries. Regards,Chris', '2004-02-29 21:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
