(885964, 59876, 16912, '<td valign="top">Gordon, this was one of the first challenges I saw when I joined as a full member and it almost made me ask for my money back! Its been in my favourites for a while, I must have forgotten to comment.<br/> <br/>Rather than being daunted by it, I now aspire to similar greatness but not sure I''ll live long enough. Whilst I doubt getting the image like this was simple, thats what it conveys and makes it a stronger image.</td>', 'Gordon, this was one of the first challenges I saw when I joined as a full member and it almost made me ask for my money back! Its been in my favourites for a while, I must have forgotten to comment. Rather than being daunted by it, I now aspire to similar greatness but not sure I''ll live long enough. Whilst I doubt getting the image like this was simple, thats what it conveys and makes it a stronger image.', '2004-08-31 20:16:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(894564, 60255, 1031, '<td valign="top">This is great ... reminds me (positively) of some photos taken by a freind of mine, who is my only real contact with the world of professional photography.<br/> <br/>The flames seem to have gotten a little over-exposed/banded, but this is a minor flaw which in no way detracts from the impact of the photo. I''ve become a fan of the square crop, and it works well with your composition.<br/> <br/>If we get an "Industrial" gallery category I hope you put it there.</td>', 'This is great ... reminds me (positively) of some photos taken by a freind of mine, who is my only real contact with the world of professional photography. The flames seem to have gotten a little over-exposed/banded, but this is a minor flaw which in no way detracts from the impact of the photo. I''ve become a fan of the square crop, and it works well with your composition. If we get an "Industrial" gallery category I hope you put it there.', '2004-09-06 00:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
